1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Sarah, daughter of Samuel & Hannah (Hitchcock) Parsons.  1st wife of Joseph Sexton, son of Joseph & Hannah (Wright) Saxton.  10 children. He married the widow Mary Collins 2nd; 1 child.
2 CONT
2 CONT From https://minerdescent.com/2010/08/25/robert-pease-jr/
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. Robert Pease.  Robert’s wife Hannah Sexton was born 9 May 1730 in Enfield, CT. Her parents were Joseph Sexton and Sarah Parsons. Hannah died 22 Aug 1795 in Enfield, Hartford, CT.
