1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Pease-1214
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Phelps formerly Pease was born on 11 Mar 1681 in Salem, Essex, Massachusetts to Robert Pease and Abigail (Randall) Pease. She is the sister of Sarah (Pease) Stockwell [half], William Pease, Abigail (Pease) Howard, Robert Peas
2 CONC e Jr, Samuel Pease, Daniel Pease, Hannah (Pease) Miller, Margaret Pease and Ebenezer Pease.Mary married Israel Phelps on 7 Mar 1703 in Westfield, Massachusetts. Her children are Mary (Phelps) Osborn, Israel Phelps and Hannah (Phel
2 CONC ps) Osborn. Mary died on 16 Apr 1713 in Lebanon, New London, Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT Profile last modified 4 Feb 2019 | Created 20 Oct 2015
2 CONT
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Pease Birth: 11 Mar 1681 • Salem, Essex, Massachusetts Death: 16 Apr 1713 • Lebanon, New London, Connecticut Father: Robert Pease (1656–1774) Mother: Abigail Randall (1660–1718) Marriage & Family
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Israel Phelps Children: Israel Phelps Mary Phelps Hannah Phelps "Phelps, Israel — a first settler near Scantic, married for first wife Mary Pease, 1703, had one son, Israel, who married Hannah Bement, daughter of William B
2 CONC . 1731, had a son Israel b. 1733, left town. Israel Phelps, sen’r., married for second wife, widow Rachel Jones, 1713, had two sons, David b. 1716, m. Margaret Colton, 1737, d. 1803, left a family, Noah b. 1726."[1]
2 CONT
