1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Lieut. Joseph Bartholomew Sr.=
2 CONT * BIRTH 6 May 1721 New Haven, New Haven County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * DEATH 27 Oct 1781 (aged 60) Wallingford, New Haven County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * BURIAL Burial Details Unknown 
2 CONT * MEMORIAL ID 63461233  
2 CONT
2 CONT Lieut. Joseph Bartholomew Sr. son of Andrew and Hannah (Frisbie) Bartholomew who married Mary (Sexton) Bartholomew ~ married 1741/42, Wallingford, New Haven Co., CT,  Joseph Sr. was the owner of a very large farm in the southeaste
2 CONC rn part of Wallingford near the Branford line, where he resided all his life.  He was a Minute Man from Wallingford at the Lexington Alarm and commanded by commission from the General Court all those subject to military duty in th
2 CONC e town. 
2 CONT
2 CONT His heirs filed the following agreement 5 Dec., 1785, in place of a will.   "that as God in his providence hath lately removed our Hon father Lieut. Joseph Bartholomew of Wallingford by death and as there was not will left by our 
2 CONC hon father in what manner his est. should be disposed off.   We therefore have mutually agreed, subscribed with our hands & set to our seals that the following agreement shall be binding between us.   Praying that the God of love 
2 CONC & peace may keep and maintain that love & union betwixt us that hath ever subsisted among us from our early days."  Then follows the division, signed by widow Mary Bartholomew, Ichabod and Hannah Russell, Andrew, Isaac, Joseph, Jo
2 CONC nathan and Ira Bartholomew, Atwater and Mary Cook and Moses Bartholomew.  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Parents'''
2 CONT Andrew Bartholomew 1670–1755
2 CONT Hannah Frisbie Bartholomew 1681–1741
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Spouses'''
2 CONT Mary Sexton Bartholomew Atwater 1719–1814
2 CONT Mary Sexton Bartholomew 1719–1814
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Siblings'''
2 CONT William Bartholomew 1699–1734
2 CONT Samuel Bartholomew 1706–1795
2 CONT Daniel Bartholomew 1708–1777
2 CONT Rebecca Bartholomew Hall 1712–1798
2 CONT Rev Andrew Bartholomew 1714–1776
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children'''
2 CONT Capt Andrew Bartholomew 1744–1818
2 CONT Isaac Bartholomew 1749–1821 m Martha Moss/Morse
2 CONT Joseph Bartholomew Jr 1752–1808 m Ester Osborne
2 CONT Jonathan Bartholomew 1755–1846
2 CONT Moses Bartholomew 1762–1804
2 CONT
