2 CONT * BIRTH 23 Mar 1764
2 CONT * DEATH 27 Dec 1842 (aged 78)
2 CONT * BURIAL Leona Cemetery, Springfield, Bradford County, Pennsylvania, USA
2 CONT * MEMORIAL ID 9479432
2 CONT
2 CONT Rhoda was born in Sommers, Connecticut & died in Leona, Bradford County, Pennsylvania.  She was wife of Ezekiel Leonard Sr., Mother of Abigail, Laura, Ezekiel Jr., Nathaniel, Lyman, Eber, Frederic, Albert & Alfred
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Spouse'''
2 CONT Ezekiel Leonard 1751–1834 (m. 1793)
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children'''
