2 CONT 12 SOME DESCENDANTS OF GEORGE SEXTON  OF WESTFIELD, MASSACHUSETTS  Compiled from the notes of Howard N. Saxton, Albany, New York,  and James Saxton, Blissfield, Michigan  [http://www.geni.com/people/George-Sexton/60000000069639631
2 CONC 87?through=6000000006964077123 Part 1]  and [http://www.usgennet.org/usa/ne/topic/resources/OLLibrary/Journals/NMGR/Vol11/nmgrp008.html Part 2]
