2 CONT
2 CONT 14 Donald B.  Jr. and Georgie Benton, Sextons Note book,  The, no date manuscript, pg. 13.  George Sexton b. ca 1618 England died ca. 1689 Windsor Connecticut. m. Katherine [-?-]  Emigrated to Windsor, Connecuiit from England in 1
2 CONC 663. Had six childred - three in Limerick, Ireland and three after arriving in Connecuitt.  pg. 19 George Sexton b. 1632 Yorkshire, England died 31 October 1689 Windsor Connedticut. Hartford county Connecticut. Deed recorded 10 Ju
2 CONC n 1663 in Windosr, Connecticut. Estate was inventoried 19 Jan. 1690.  Married 1656 Windsor, England Berkshire Catherine Bird   They emgrated to Windsow, Connecticut in 1663."
2 CONT
2 CONT ==GEDCOM Note==
2 CONT 15 Family Data Collection - Individual Records on ancestry 2007 George Sexton Birth Place: England, OR Birth Date: 1632 Death Place: Westfield, Hampden, MA Death Date: 31 Oct 1690 Spouse: Mrs Katherine K Sexton Marriage Place: Win
