2 CONT Lt. Abel Wright was stationed in Skipmuck during the attack by Indians on 26 July 1708 his wife, Martha, was aflicted with wounds of scalping by the Indians. Martha later died from complications of  this scalping.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
