1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Thomas and Martha had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Martha Morley b 7 SEP 1682 m William Loomis 13 JAN 1702/03 d 22 FEB 1753   
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas Morley b 14 SEP 1684  d JAN 1772  (father of Timothy father of Thomas father of Isaac b. 1786 married Lucy Gunn)
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Morley b 30 OCT 1686 d 22 FEB 1753  
2 CONT
2 CONT Abel Morley b 18 JAN 1688/89 d 17 JAN 1771  (our line)
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Morley b 23 JUN 1691  
2 CONT
2 CONT Thankful Morley b 28 FEB 1692/93  
2 CONT
2 CONT Mercy Morley b 14 NOV 1695  
2 CONT
2 CONT John Morley b 12 MAR 1698/99 d 1 NOV 1757  
2 CONT
2 CONT Ebenezer Morley b 22 MAR 1700/01 d 26 JAN 1747/48  
2 CONT
2 CONT Savage:
2 CONT
2 CONT     MARLO, MORLEY, or MARLOW, EDWARD, Hartford 1667. THOMAS, 
2 CONT
2 CONT Westfield, m. 8 Dec. 1681, Martha, d. of the first Abel Wright, had
2 CONT
2 CONT Martha, b. 7 Sept. 1682; Thomas, 14 Sept. 1684; Mary, 30 Oct. 1686;
2 CONT
2 CONT Abel, 18 Jan. 1689; Elizabeth 23 June 1691; Thankful, 28 Feb. 1693;
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary, again, 14 Nov. 1695; John, 1 May 1699; and Ebenezer, 22
2 CONT
2 CONT Mar. 1701. The fam. may be still at W. but the name long since bec.
2 CONT
2 CONT Morley. WILLIAM, a soldier under capt. Turner in Mar. 1676.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Removed Martha Morley (Wright) as the wife of Thomas.  I'm not sure how this relationship was created, but it was done in error.  I don't know what Martha's maiden name was, but I found a book called New England Marriages prior to
2 CONC  1700 that lists Thomas's marriage to Martha, and on the same page lists Martha Wright's marriage to Thomas Marlow/Morley.  (If this link doesn't paste correctly, check the references tab).
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://books.google.com/books?id=mOgK8dM9qqUC&lpg=PA519&ots=ZgJp9gFENg&dq=martha%20morley%201662%20morrell&pg=PA519#v=onepage&q=martha%20morley%201662%20morrell&f=false]
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT http://www.genealogyofnewengland.com/f_3cd.htm#10
2 CONT
