1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From https://minerdescent.com/2010/08/25/robert-pease-jr/
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. Robert Pease
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert’s wife Hannah Sexton was born 9 May 1730 in Enfield, CT. Her parents were Joseph Sexton and Sarah Parsons. Hannah died 22 Aug 1795 in Enfield, Hartford, CT.
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert was a revolutionary soldier, enlisting July 6, 1775, in Eighth Regiment, discharged December 16, 1777;
2 CONT
2 CONT He removed to Blandford, Mass about 1780 and lived there a short time where he lost most of his wealth by the depreciation of “continental money.”   He returned to Somers where he died in 1805.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Robert and Hannah:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. Robert Pease (1749 – 1827)
2 CONT
2 CONT ii.  Abiah Pease Pease (1753 – 1786)
2 CONT
2 CONT iii.  Erastus Pease (1760 – 1790)
2 CONT
2 CONT iv.  Alpheus Pease (1762 – 1816)
2 CONT
2 CONT v.  Charles Pease (1764 – 1839)
2 CONT
2 CONT vi.  Sarah Pease (1766 – 1778)
