1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Mary Pease .
2 CONT * Birth:	Oct 8 1658 - Salem, Essex county, MA, USA
2 CONT * Death:	May 29 1737 - Enfield, Connecticut
2 CONT * Parents:	Cpt. John Pease Sr., Mary Goodale
2 CONT * Spouse: Hugh Pasco
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary’s husband Hugh Pasco was born in 1640 Cornwall, England. He first married 20 Feb 1670 Salem, Essex, Massachusetts to Sarah Wooland b. : Abt. 1649; d. 3 Jun 1676 Salem, Essex, Mass.  Two children in this mariage. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He later married '''Mary Pease''' and there were nine children from this marriage.
2 CONT
2 CONT Hugh Pasco and Mary Pease had at least five daughters, Mary, Abigail, Margaret, Hannah and Elizabeth. Hugh and Mary moved from Salem, Mass., to Enfield, now in Conn.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes
2 CONT
2 CONT Controversy about her parents?
2 CONT
2 CONT - one source says she was born in Salem, if so she was the daughter of a mother who'd been dead for two years. - seen as John PEASE (bef 20 Nov 1608 - 3 Jun 1689) & Mary “Marie” BROWNING (abt 1625 - aft 1695)
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT # [http://books.google.com/books?id=nh0FAAAAQAAJ&lpg=PA15&ots=CvjxOyl3NE&dq=mary%20pease%20hugh%20pasco&pg=PA15#v=onepage&q=mary%20pease%20hugh%20pasco&f=false historical collections of the essex institute] (Google eBook) 1861.  P
2 CONC age 15.  "Hugh Pasco marryed to '''Mary Pease''', being his second wife, the 16 December. 1678; theire daught'r Mary borne the 9th day of October, 1680; Margarett Pasco, daughter of Hugh Pasco & Mary his wife, was borne 17th Feb'y
2 CONC , 1694-5; Jonathan son as afores'd, borne ye 11th day October. 1696."
2 CONT # [http://books.google.com/books?id=FsJTNxM7qdEC&lpg=PA173&ots=qbgtreETfR&dq=mary%20pease%20hugh%20pasco&pg=PA173#v=onepage&q=mary%20pease%20hugh%20pasco&f=false Genealogical Periodical Annual Index,] Volume 34.  By Leslie K. Towl
2 CONC e Anna Liisa Fielding.  Page 173.  "Pease, Mary, bc 1640, h Nathaniel Carroll, MA, fam hist AG 70:4:205.  Mary, m 1678, h Hugh Pasco, MA, fam hist AG 70:4:205."
2 CONT * https://s3.amazonaws.com/photos.geni.com/p13/cf/57/d3/d0/5344483bde91b30d/three_mary_peases_original.pdf Links
2 CONT * http://genforum.genealogy.com/pascoe/messages/319.html
2 CONT * http://capecodgenes.com/web%20cards/ps31/ps31_319.html
