1 NOTE {geni:about_me} "Phelps, Israel — a first settler near Scantic, married for first wife Mary Pease, 1703, had one son, Israel, who married Hannah Bement, daughter of William B. 1731, had a son Israel b. 1733, left town. Israel Phel
2 CONC ps, sen’r., married for second wife, widow Rachel Jones, 1713, had two sons, David b. 1716, m. Margaret Colton, 1737, d. 1803, left a family, Noah b. 1726."[1]
