1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 24. ELIZABETH8 MERRILL (ABRAHAM7 +MERRILL, NATHANIEL6 *MERRILL, NATHANIEL5, JOHN4 *MERRELL, THE YOUNGER, JOHN3 *MERYELL, JOHN2, THOMAS1) was born April 26, 1669 in Newbury, Essex, Mass, and died Aft. 1712 in Andove
2 CONC r, Mass. She married JOSEPH EMERY October 2, 1693 in Newbury, Essex, Mass, son of JOHN EMERY and MARY WEBSTER. He was born March 23, 1662/63 in Newbury, Essex, Mass, and died September 22, 1721 in Andover, Mass.
