1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Hannah Frisbie Bartholomew=
2 CONT * BIRTH 18 Jan 1681 Branford, New Haven County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * DEATH 2 Feb 1741 (aged 60) Branford, New Haven County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * BURIAL Burial Details Unknown. Specifically: Lost to time
2 CONT * MEMORIAL ID 49471483 photos added by Tioga, Courtesy by Jacelqlynn Bailey (#48959328) ~ 2018
2 CONT
2 CONT Hannah Frisbie Bartholomew was born 18 Jan 1681 Branford, New Haven County, Connecticut, the daughter of 
2 CONT John Frisbie & Ruth Bowers Frisbie.  She was the wife of Andrew Bartholomew married in 1698 with whom she had 6 known children with.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Notes==
2 CONT After further research, Hannah actually died on 2 Feb 1741. In that era, February was the 12th month of the year, which is why after you will see dates off by 3 months. It most likely was inscribed "2nd day of 12th month 1740." In
2 CONC  our era, we would've referred to that as 2nd day of February 1741, since the year would have changed. :-)
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Parents'''
2 CONT John Frisbie 1650–1693
2 CONT Ruth Bowers Frisbie 1657–1736
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Spouse'''
2 CONT Andrew Bartholomew 1670–1755 (m. 1698)
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Siblings'''
2 CONT John Frisbie Jr. 1676–1736
2 CONT Edward Frisbie 1677–1741
2 CONT Rebecca Frisbie Bartholomew 1679–1738
2 CONT Joseph Frisbie I 1688–1758
2 CONT Lydia Frisbie Rogers 1693–1751
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children'''
2 CONT William Bartholomew 1699–1734
2 CONT Samuel Bartholomew 1706–1795
2 CONT Daniel Bartholomew 1708–1777
2 CONT Rebecca Bartholomew Hall 1712–1798
2 CONT Rev Andrew Bartholomew 1714–1776
2 CONT Joseph Bartholomew 1721–1781
2 CONT
