1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =William Bartholomew=
2 CONT * BIRTH 2 Dec 1699 Branford, New Haven County, Connecticut
2 CONT * BAPTIZED Feb 1700 (upon parental right)
2 CONT * DEATH 7 Sep 1734 (aged 34) Branford, New Haven County, Connecticut
2 CONT * BURIAL Branford Center Cemetery, Branford, New Haven County, Connecticut
2 CONT * MEMORIAL ID 74230853 photos added by Gayle, Additional info courtesy of Gayle (47223271)
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Biography==  
2 CONT William Bartholomew was born 2 Dec 1699 Branford, New Haven County, Connecticut to Andrew Bartholomew and Hannah Frisbie.  He was eldest of 11 and likely named after his paternal grandfather.  His other siblings were Susannah; Han
2 CONC nah; Samuel; Daniel; Rebeccah; Andrew; Timothy; Joseph; John and Martha.
2 CONT
2 CONT He 1st married Abigail Brown of New Haven, the daughter of Gershom Brown and Hannah Mansfield, on 25 Jan 1721/22 by Rev. Jacob Heminway. She died August, 1726 after having 2 children, Gersham b 1722; and Abigail b 1724 together.  
2 CONC After her passing, he 2nd married Hannah (Hickox) Williams of Wallingford, a widow, on 7 Dec 1726 by Hon. Theophilus Yale, JP. and had 3 children: Seth b 1729; Levi b 1731; and Susannah b 1734 with him.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Notes==  
2 CONT Not certain why he is named as "William Jr." in vital records except as a homage to his paternal grandfather for whom (apparently) he was name.
2 CONT
2 CONT ''This William is the same as https://www.geni.com/people/nn-Bartholomew/6000000104957121892.  Merge requested August 10, 2024.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1-16-25 m hill 48242442 added Branford to birth and death place, and changed death year from 1739 to 1734.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Parents'''
2 CONT Andrew Bartholomew 1670–1755
2 CONT Hannah Frisbie Bartholomew 1681–1741
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Spouses'''
2 CONT Abigail Brown Bartholomew 1705–1726 (m. 1721)
2 CONT Hannah Hickox Ingraham 1699–1788 (m. 1726)
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Siblings'''
2 CONT Samuel Bartholomew 1706–1795
2 CONT Daniel Bartholomew 1708–1777
2 CONT Rebecca Bartholomew Hall 1712–1798
2 CONT Rev Andrew Bartholomew 1714–1776
2 CONT Joseph Bartholomew 1721–1781
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children'''
2 CONT Gershom Bartholomew 1722–1764
2 CONT
