2 CONT Daniel Bartholomew, born 16 Oct 1708 in Branford, CT.; died 25 Oct 1777 in Harwington, CT.. He was the son of Andrew Bartholomew and Hannah Frisbie. He married Elizabeth Bef. 1753.  She was born 14 Apr 1716; died 05 Dec 1785.
