1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Rev Andrew Bartholomew=
2 CONT * BIRTH 7 Nov 1714 Branford, New Haven County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * DEATH 6 Mar 1776 (aged 61) Harwinton, Litchfield County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * BURIAL Old Cemetery, Harwinton, Litchfield County, Connecticut, USA 
2 CONT * MEMORIAL ID 85284156  
2 CONT
2 CONT Rev Andrew Bartholomew was born 7 Nov 1714 Branford, New Haven County, CT to Andrew Bartholomew and Hannah Frisbie Bartholomew.  He married Sarah Catlin Bartholomew on 29 Oct. 1740 in Harwinton, CT.  
2 CONT
2 CONT "Death of the first pastor — Few persons probably are aware that the sixth of March is the one hundredth anniversary of the death of Rev. Andrew Bartholomew, the first settled pastor of the Harwinton church. Yet such is the fact. 
2 CONC By reference to the early books of the town, we find it recorded that "The Rev. Andrew Bartholomew departed this life, Mar. 6th, 1776, on Wednesday - sun half-an-hour high. In the 63d year of his age." [2]  On no costly monument a
2 CONC re his merits emblazoned, but a plain gneissic slab in the ancient grave-yard.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Transcription'''
2 CONT Here lies the Body of the Rev. Andrew Bartholomew,
2 CONT The 1st pastor of the church
2 CONT of Christ in Harwinton, who
2 CONT With filial regard for the
2 CONT Glory of God, studiously
2 CONT Labored in the vineyard
2 CONT of Christ 38 years. A lover
2 CONT of piety, peace and good
2 CONT order and zealous for the faith
2 CONT he died March the 6th A.D. 1776
2 CONT in the 63d year of his age.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Parents'''
2 CONT Andrew Bartholomew 1670–1755
2 CONT Hannah Frisbie Bartholomew 1681–1741
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Spouse'''
2 CONT Sarah Catlin Bartholomew 1718–1789 m 29 Oct. 1740, Harwinton, CT.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Siblings'''
2 CONT William Bartholomew 1699–1734
2 CONT Samuel Bartholomew 1706–1795
2 CONT Daniel Bartholomew 1708–1777
2 CONT Rebecca Bartholomew Hall 1712–1798
2 CONT Joseph Bartholomew 1721–1781
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children'''
2 CONT Sarah Bartholomew Bull 1743–1783
2 CONT Sarah Bartholomew 1743 – unknown
2 CONT Capt Andrew Bartholomew 1745–1821
2 CONT Sabra Bartholomew Wilson 1759–1817
2 CONT Sarah Bartholomew 1773–1773
2 CONT
2 CONT ==References==
2 CONT 1 https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/85284156/andrew-bartholomew
2 CONT
2 CONT 2 1876 Newspaper clipping, VonTobel Scrapbook, Harwinton Historical Society.
2 CONT
