2 CONT The son of John & Abigail (Mansfield) Atwater, he married Sarah Merriman, daughter of John & Elizabeth (Peck) Merriman, on Dec. 28, 1722 in Wallingford, New Haven. After Sarah's death, he married Mary Hotchkiss on April 22, 1734. 
