1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.archive.org/stream/reunionofdescend00merriala/reunionofdescend00merriala_djvu.txt
2 CONT
2 CONT 18. ELiASAPH 3 MERRIMAN, 
2 CONT *son of Caleb 2 (No. 8), was born at Wallingford 20 May 1695, 
2 CONT *died there 19 Aug 1758; 
2 CONT *married there 10 Dec 1719 Abigail Hulls, 
2 CONT **daughter of Dr. Benjamin and Elizabeth (Andrews) Hulls, who was born at Wallingford 14 Feb 1704 and 
2 CONT **died there 20 Jan 1774. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was ensign of the military company in Wallingford in 1735, lieutenant in 1740, and captain in 1743. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children, all born in Wallingford: 
2 CONT *EUNICE/ born 7 Oct 1720, died 12 Jan 1721. 
2 CONT *EUNICE, born 24 Dec 1721; married (i) at Wallingford 9 Dec 1747 Samuel Doolittle who was born 9 Dec 1721, died 14 May 1749; married (2) at Wallingford 25 March 1754 Capt. Ephraim Preston who was born 8 Sept 1709, died 8 April 177
2 CONC 8. 
2 CONT *SARAH, born 18 Nov 1723; married at Wallingford 8 June 1743 Nathaniel Jones who was born in 1717. 
2 CONT *CALEB, born 3 Sept 1725. (No. 36) 
2 CONT *TITUS, born 28 August 1727. (No. 37) 
2 CONT *AMASA, born 17 June 1729. (No. 38) 
2 CONT *ENOCH, born i May 1731, died 14 June 1731. 
2 CONT *ELIZABETH, born 27 July 1732, was living at Barkhamsted 1787 (Wallingford Deeds, vol. 24, p. 295); married at Wallingford 25 May 1756 Reuben Preston who was born 27 May 1736, died 5 Aug 1765. 
2 CONT *ESTHER, born 2 Dec 1734, died 25 May 1787; married at Wallingford 5 April 1762 Ephraim Preston Jr. who was born 6 Aug 1734, died 21 April 1786. 
2 CONT *ELIASAPH, born 2 Nov 1736. (No. 39) 
2 CONT *ENOCH and EBENEZER, twins, born 26 May 1739, died young. 
2 CONT *TURHAND, born 24 May 1741, died young. 
2 CONT *CHARLES, born 2 Sept 1744, died young. 
2 CONT *ABIGAIL, born 17 June 1749, killed by lightning 4 Aug. 1758. 
2 CONT
