1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Ezekiel Leonard Sr.=
2 CONT * BIRTH 30 Jul 1751 Springfield, Hampden County, Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT * DEATH 30 Aug 1834 (aged 83) Leona, Bradford County, Pennsylvania, USA
2 CONT * BURIAL Leona Cemetery, Springfield, Bradford County, Pennsylvania, USA
2 CONT * MEMORIAL ID 9479426 Photos by Gone Too Soon
2 CONT
2 CONT Ezekiel was the son of Preserved Leonard & Sarah (Keep) Leonard, Husband of Rhoda (Saxton) Leonard born in Springfield, Hampden County, Massachusetts & died in Leona, Bradford County, Pennsylvania.  He fought in the Revolution and
2 CONC  was father of Abigail, Laura, Ezekiel Jr., Nathaniel, Lyman, Eber, Frederic, Albert & Alfred
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Parents'''
2 CONT Preserved Leonard 1728–1801
2 CONT Sarah Keep Leonard 1731–1761
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Spouse'''
2 CONT Rhoda Saxton Leonard 1764–1842 (m. 1793)
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Siblings'''
2 CONT Preserved Leonard 1772–1829
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Half Siblings'''
2 CONT Eli Leonard 1762–1787
2 CONT Salmon Leonard 1766–1786
2 CONT Fanny Leonard Leonard 1768–1847
2 CONT Mary Leonard Cooper 1770–1855
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children'''
2 CONT Laura Leonard Northam 1785–1854
2 CONT Ezekiel Leonard 1787–1869
2 CONT Eber Leonard 1795–1871
2 CONT Frederick Leonard 1799–1882
2 CONT
