1 NOTE {geni:about_me} First Wife: Elizabeth Pease
2 CONT Cummings married Elizabeth Pease around 1739. She was his second cousin once removed. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Their children are:'''
2 CONT Love Pease: Born around 1740; she later married John Hills.
2 CONT Ebenezer Pease: Born around 1742; a resident of Enfield who was active in local affairs.
2 CONT Cummings Pease Jr.: Born in 1744; he was a Revolutionary War veteran who served at the Siege of Boston.
2 CONT Arie Asa Pease: Born around 1748.
2 CONT Ruth Pease: Born around 1750; she later married into the Hale family.
