2 CONT John fenn John Fenn, 1702 - 1793 John Fenn was born on month day 1702, at birth place, Connecticut, to Edward Fenn and Mary Elizabeth Fenn (born Thorpe). Edward was born on November 15 1644, in Wallingford, New Haven County, Conne
2 CONC cticut Colony, British Colonial America. Mary was born on October 31 1666, in Of, Wallingford, New Haven, Connecticut, US. John was baptized circa 1712, at baptism place, Connecticut. He had 11 siblings: Thomas Fenn, Mary Doolittl
2 CONC e (born Fenn) and 9 other siblings. John married Sarah Fenn (born Benton) on month day 1729, at age 27 at marriage place. Sarah was born on March 19 1706, in Guilford, New Haven, Connecticut Colony. They had 4 children: John Fenn 
2 CONC and 3 other children. John passed away on month day 1793, at age 91 at death place, Connecticut.
2 CONT
2 CONT + 17 Documents of John Fenn John fenn John Fenn in Encyclopedia of Connecticut Biography, Genealogical-Memorial; Representative Citizens, 1917 "... grandmother of Johanna Prudden, who married Lieutenant James Fenn. Their son, John
2 CONC  Fenn, born 1714, died September 4, 1793. He married Susannah Gibson, born 1727, died February 13, 1797, daughter of Gamaliel ..." Publication date: 1917
2 CONT
2 CONT John Fenn, 1702 - 1753 John Fenn was born on March 23 1702, in Wallingford Twp, New Haven, CT, to Edward Fenn and Mary Fenn. John had 8 siblings: Sarah Jones, Theophilus Fenn, Mary Doolittle, Thomas Fenn, Benjamin Fenn, Elizabeth 
2 CONC Dunbar, Hannah Fenn and Naomi Frost. John married Sarah A Fenn on November 13 1729, at age 27 in New Haven, Connecticut. They had 5 children: John Fenn Jr, Mary Parsons, Lois Fenn, Amos Fenn and Samuel Fenn. John passed away in Fe
2 CONC bruary 1753, at age 50 in Plymouth, Litchfield, Connecticut.
