2 CONT *Maria Josephine Hill Searle (1840 - 1929)*
2 CONT
2 CONT  Children:
2 CONT *Sarah Ann Searle Nielsen (1854 - 1942)*
2 CONT *Luna Estella Searle Whitmill (1860 - 1917)*
2 CONT *Leonard Breed Searle (1864 - 1916)*
2 CONT *James Henry Searle (1875 - 1957)*
