1 NOTE {geni:about_me} NOTE: Ancestry also has a Christopher Sexton of the same era as father with children of the same names and birthdates. We NEED real documents to settle the matter but, for what it's worth, most trees have Stephen &
2 CONC  Allison Sexton as parents.
2 CONT
2 CONT James SEXTON was born in 1604 in Limerick, Munster, Ireland. He died on 14 December 1669 at the age of 65 in Limerick, Munster, Ireland. Parents: Stephen SEXTEN and Alson WHITE.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Mrs. James SEXTON. Mrs. James SEXTON and James SEXTON were married before 1619 in , , , Ireland. Children were: George SEXTON, Symen SEXTON, Patrick SEXTON, Joseph SEXTON, Stephen SEXTON, Joan SEXTON, Richard SEXTON.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT  Donald B.  Jr. and Georgie Benton, Sextons Note book,  The, no date manuscript,
