2 CONT Hanna Spencer was born on April 15, 1653 in Haddam, Middlesex, Connecticut  	             She was Christened on  Apr 1653 at First Church, Middletown, Middlesex Co, Connecticut 	 
2 CONT
2 CONT Hanna spencer married Daniel Brainerd 29 Nov 1698 of Hartford, Hartford, England 	
2 CONT
2 CONT She died April 1, 1715 in Haddam, Middlesex, Connecticut and was buried  
2 CONT
2 CONT at Ancient Burying, Haddam, Middlesex, Ct. 	 
