2 CONT
2 CONT 8 Sons of the American Revolution Ann Bancroft is documented as the wife of James Saxton in an ''approved application'' of the sons of the american revolution dated 11/28/1927  Application made by: Lisle Daniel Tucker (b.12/29/187
2 CONC 1) , lineal descendant of Alanson Saxton (b.1/15/1752 Sheffield, MA- c.1810)> James Saxton (1729-1793) > James Saxton (1702- ?) > James Saxton (1658-1741) who married '''Anna Bancroft''' (?-1733)  "The services of Alanson Bancroft
2 CONC  were with 9th Regiment Albany County, New York Militia (Land Bounty Rights)"
2 CONT
