2 CONT 7. Thomas' Morley (Abel,* Thomas1), born at Glastonbury 6 Mar.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1723-4, married at Westfield, 15 Nov. 1753, Sarah Phelps, 
2 CONT
2 CONT daughter of Isaac, 3d. He probably married secondly at Feeding 
2 CONT
2 CONT Hills, 29 Sept. 1779, Sarah Church of Westfield, who died at 
2 CONT
2 CONT Brutus, N. Y., 20 Sept. 1795. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children, recorded at Westfield : 
2 CONT
2 CONT I. Sarah,' b. 16 June 1766.
