1 NOTE Thomas Chapin, son of Thomas and Sarah, b. Jan. 2, 1694,
2 CONT m. March 19, 1719-20, Jerusha Jones of Sunderland.
2 CONT Thomas Chapin removed to Belchertown, (formerly called Cold
2 CONT Spring,) about 1748, was a member of the church there at the time
2 CONT of the ordination of the Rev. Justus Forward, Feb. 25, 1756, and
2 CONT d. in 1781, ae. 86. His wife, Jerusha, d. in 1773, ae. 77. She was
2 CONT also a member of the same church with her husband.
1 NOTE Belchertown was formerly called Cold Water.
