2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Thomas Chapin and Sarah (Wright) Chapin.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married, first, on May 26,1726, Thankful Dickinson.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married, second, as her third husband, on Nov 3,1778, Lydia (Todd) Doolittle Belding.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children(by first marriage): Thankful Chapin Kellogg, Japhet Chapin Jr, Hepzibah Chapin Miller, Martha Chapin Chapin, Nathan Chapin, Rhoda Chapin Day, Simeon Chapin, Chloe Chapin, Catherine Chapin Sexton, and Sarah Chapin Chapin.
2 CONT
