1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Not the same as https://www.geni.com/people/Nathaniel-Bliss-of-Longmeadow/6000000002414612375, son of Samuel Bliss & Sarah Stebbins, who married Mary Morgan & Mary Dorchester.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Bliss-385
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Nathaniel Bliss''' was born in Springfield on January 26, 1671, the son of John and Patience [Burt] Bliss, and died in New Lebanon in 1751.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family 
2 CONT
2 CONT Nathaniel Bliss, married Mary Wright of Springfield, Massachusetts, on February 3, 1697/8.
2 CONT
2 CONT Excerpted from Winchester Fitch's 1906 article in'' The New York Genealogical and Biographical Record'', p. 35, and John H. Bliss' ''Genealogy of the Bliss Family'', p. 43:
2 CONT
2 CONT John Bliss, brother of Lawrence Bliss, married Patience Burt. Their son, Nathaniel Bliss, married Mary Wright of Springfield, Massachusetts, on February 3, 1697. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Their children were:
2 CONT # Nathaniel, died young. Born in Springfield.
2 CONT # Henry, born October 25, 1701; married Bethia Spafford. Born in Enfield.
2 CONT # Nathaniel, born October 26 1704; married Mehitable Spafford on September 4, 1723/24. Born in Enfield.
2 CONT # Mary, born March 3, 1706; married Moses Hatch on February 1, 1748. Born in Lebanon, Connecticut.
2 CONT # Martha, born October 30, 1709; married Jabez Lyman on January 29, 1730. Born in Lebanon, Connecticut.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT {{https://www.geni.com/media/proxy?media_id=6000000194792842874&size=large}}
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===References 
2 CONT # Bliss, John Homer. Genealogy of the Bliss family in America. (Boston, Mass., J. H. Bliss, 1881).  page 64.  < [https://archive.org/details/genealogyofbliss01blis/page/64/mode/2up Archive.Org] >
2 CONT # https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Bliss-385 cites 
2 CONT ## Vital Records of Springfield, Births, Book 1, p. 23: "Bliss... Nathaneel, s. John and Patience, Jan. 26, 1671." http://ma-vitalrecords.org/MA/Hampden/Springfield/BirthsB.shtml.
2 CONT ## "Massachusetts Births and Christenings, 1639-1915", database, FamilySearch (https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:3QS7-L9XW-XLYM?i=79) image 80/164.
2 CONT ## Fitch, Winchester. The Throope Family and the Scrope Tradition, The New York Genealogical and Biographical Record (NYGBS, New York, 1906) Vol. 37, Page 35.
2 CONT ## Ancestral File Number: 2B7X-6C
2 CONT ## Early Vital Records of Massachusetts from 1600 to 1850. Online database of images and transcriptions courtesy of John Slaughter, Massachusetts Vital Records Project. http://ma-vitalrecords.org
