1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Thomas Douglas
2 CONT BIRTH	15 May 1679, New London, New London County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT DEATH	3 Mar 1724 (aged 44), New London, New London County, Connecticut, USA aged 45 years
2 CONT BURIAL	Ancient Cemetery, New London, New London County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT MEMORIAL ID 11355701, Photos by Heidi Cannon
2 CONT
2 CONT He was admitted to church privileges April 9, 1710, and was a prominent member of the New London church. He also held several important town offices. He was chosen collector in 1711. He died March 3, 1724-5. His inventory was £776
2 CONC . His widow married, Dec 30, 1731, Samuel CHAPMAN. She died in 1758. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Page 67; #8; A collection of family records: with biographical sketches, and other memoranda of various families and individuals bearing the name DOUGLAS or Allied to families of that name. By Charles Henry James Douglas ©1879]
2 CONT
2 CONT Inscription
2 CONT Here Lyeth The Body of Thomas Douglas Who Died March 3 1724
2 CONT
