2 CONT Jonathan Calkins was born in July 9, 1678 and was baptized March 30, 1679 in New London, New London CT. He passed away in 1750.  The son of Mary Bliss and David Calkins, m. 1672 New London, CT. David Calkins 11/3/1642 Essex, MASS 
2 CONC son of Hugh Calkins 1600-1690 and Ann Eaton 1605-1688 Hugh and Ann buried Old Norwichtown Cem.
2 CONT Jonathan was a Lieutenant in the French and Indian Wars. The Connecticut Colonial Records, Vol. 7, p. 94, show that by order of the Assembly, Session of May 11, 1727, he was appointed Lieutenant of Fourth Train-Band (or Company) o
2 CONC f Lebanon.
2 CONT At the age of 21, Jonathan Calkins m. Sarah Turner 1683-1718 daughter of Ezekial Turner & Susannah Keeney,  on 11 Dec 1700 in New London, New London, Connecticut.  Jonathan Calkins and Sarah Turner had the following 6 children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.  Jonathan Calkins  16 Sep 1701-after 1734
2 CONT 2.  Sarah (Calkins)  Calkins7 Jul 1703-3 Dec 1774  married Stephen Calkins
2 CONT 3.  Hannah Calkins   20 Jul 1705-after 1725    married Richard Edgerton
2 CONT
2 CONT 4.  Amos Calkins   14 Oct 1708-1775
2 CONT 5.  Grace (Calkins) Saxton   23 Jun 1711-after 1730 married Ezekiel Saxton
2 CONT
2 CONT 6.  Thomas Calkins   26 Jul 1713- 2 Jul 1750 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mayflower connection through William Brewster as follows:
2 CONT William Brewster & Mary Love Wentworth
2 CONT Jonathan Brewster & Lucretia Oldham
2 CONT Mary Brewster & John Turner
2 CONT Ezekial Turner & Susannah Keeney
2 CONT Sarah Turner & Jonathan Calkins
2 CONT
2 CONT Above information supplied by FAG Member Sherry Hosford
2 CONT ==
2 CONT JONATHAN CALKINS 
2 CONT Jonathan Calkins was born on 09 Jan 1678/79 in Niantic, New London, Connecticut, USA as the third child of David Calkins and Mary Bliss. He had seven siblings, namely: David, Ann, Peter, John, Mary, Joseph, andLydia. 
2 CONT Connecticut Town Birth Records, pre-1870 (Barbour Collection) about Jonathan Calkins
2 CONT Name:	Jonathan Calkins  [Jonathan Caulkins] 
2 CONT Birth Date:	9 Jan 1678
2 CONT Birth Location:	New London
2 CONT Parent Name:	David
2 CONT Parent Name:	Mary
2 CONT Connecticut, Town Marriage Records, pre-1870 (Barbour Collection) about Sarah Turner
2 CONT Name:	Sarah Turner
2 CONT Marriage Date:	11 Dec 1700
2 CONT Marriage Location:	New London
2 CONT Spouse:	Jonathan Calkins
2 CONT Sarah Turner was born on 28 Oct 1683 in New London, Connecticut, USA as the first child of Ezekiel Turner and Susannah Keeney. She had one sibling, namely: Lucretia. 
2 CONT Connecticut Town Birth Records, pre-1870 (Barbour Collection) about Sarah Turner
2 CONT Name:	Sarah Turner
2 CONT Birth Date:	28 Oct 1683
2 CONT Birth Location:	New London
2 CONT Parent Name:	Ezekiel
2 CONT Parent Name:	Susannah
2 CONT Sarah TURNER was granddaughter of Mary Brewster, the granddaughter of Elder Brewster of the Mayflower and daughter of Jonathan and Lucretia (Oldham) Brewster. Lucretia Turner, sister of Sarah, married Joseph, brother of Lt.  Jonat
2 CONC han Calkins. Sarah Turner Calkins died on 15Aug 1718 in New London, Connecticut, USA. 
2 CONT After Sarah's death, when Jonathan Calkins was 40, he married Anne Pember on 08 Dec 1719 in New London, Connecticut, USA, daughter of ThomasPember and Mehitable Agnes Way. 
2 CONT Anne Pember was born on 15 May 1694 (sic) in New London, Connecticut, USA.  Anne Pember was christened on 02 Apr 1694 (sic) in New London, New London, Connecticut, per "Baptisms," by Gurdon Saltonstall: 1694-1696, New London Count
2 CONC y CTgenWeb.
2 CONT No children were found for Jonathan Caulkins and and Anne Pember although they likely had children.
2 CONT Jonathan Calkins died on 17 Jul 1750 in New London, Connecticut where he was buried in the Ancient Burying Ground. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Per findagrave.
2 CONT Jonathan Calkins
2 CONT Birth: 	Jan. 9, 1678
2 CONT Death: 	July 15, 1750
2 CONT Mary Bliss m. David Calkins 1672 New London, CTDavid Calkins 11/3/1642 Essex, MASS son of Hugh Calkins 1600-1690 & Ann Eaton 1605-1688 
2 CONT Hugh & Ann buried Old Norwichtown Cem.Jonathan Calkins m. Sarah Turner 1683-1718 dau. of Ezekial Turner & Susannah Keeney.
2 CONT
2 CONT
