2 CONT [[Category: New London, Connecticut]]
2 CONT == Biography ==
2 CONT Thomas was born in 1713 in New London, New London, CT, the son of Lieut. Jonathan Calkins and Sarah Turner. He married Mary Rogers in New London, New London, CT.
2 CONT Thomas and Mary had ten children. They named one of their sons Pember Calkins after Thomas' stepmother, Anne Pember. Children were: Samuel, Christopher, Jonathan (Capt.), Sarah, Joshua, Samuel, Pember, Christopher, Thomas and Mary
2 CONC .
