2 CONT Shubael Geer Sr.
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 19 Mar 1675 in Wenham, Essex, Massachusetts Bay Colony
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Thomas Geer and Deborah (Davis) Geer
2 CONT
2 CONT Brother of Mary (Geer) Prior
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Sarah (Abbe) Geer — married 27 Jan 1701 in Enfield, Hartford, Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Shubael Geer, Sarah (Geer) Simons, Deborah (Geer) Prior, Mary (Geer) Griswold, Shubael Geer Jr., Elizabeth (Geer) Terry, Thomas Geer and Anna (Geer) Pease
2 CONT
2 CONT Died after 1726 in Enfield, Hartford, Connecticut
2 CONT
