2 CONT Mother of Joseph Griffin, Margaret (Hyde) Perrin and Ephraim Hyde
2 CONT Died after 1761 after age 63 [location unknown]
2 CONT PROBLEMS/QUESTIONSProfile manager: Ellen Smith private message [send private message]
2 CONT Profile last modified 16 Dec 2022 | Created 13 Sep 2019
2 CONT This page has been accessed 64 times.
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret Morris was born in Woodstock, Connecticut, on 22 March 1696/7, a daughter of Ebenezer and Sarah (Davis) Morris. She married Joseph Griffin in Pomfret, Connecticut, on 15 March 1721/2.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph Griffin died in December 1731, and she married Ephraim Hyde as her second husband in Pomfret on 7 August 1735. [1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Ephraim Hyde died in Pomfret on 5 December 1761, and Margaret was living as his widow as of 28 December 1761, when his estate was divided.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT
