2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT Sarah & Ebenezer Morris's daughter Mary Morris was born in Woodstock, Connecticut, on 23 March 1694. She married Seth Paine in Pomfret, Connecticut, on 03 June 1719. [1]  They had  10X children before Mary was buried in South Ceme
2 CONC tery,, Pomfret, Windham, Connecticut [12]  She died 7 May 1762 in Scotland, Windham, CT
