2 CONT The Ancestry of Lydia Harmon, by Walter Davis Isaac Goodale was born in England in 1634.  He was six months old when the family sailed for America from the port of Ipswich, Suffolk Co., England on 30 April, 1634 on the ship "Eliza
2 CONC beth".  
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Patience Cook circa 1668.  
2 CONT
