2 CONT The Life Summary of Elizabeth
2 CONT
2 CONT When Elizabeth Goodale was born on 11 October 1638, in Salem, Essex, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, her father, Robert Goodale, was 44 and her mother, Kathern, was 32. She married John Smith about 1657, in Sal
2 CONC em, Essex, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 4 daughters. She died after 1692, in her hometown, at the age of 55.
