1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From https://www.genealogy.com/forum/surnames/topics/pascoe/326/: "Hugh Pasco was baptized Dec 15 1646 in the parish of St. Ewe, Fowey, Cornwall, England, according to the St. Ewe Parish Baptism register, which say
2 CONC s, ""Hugh, the sonne of Lawrence Paschoe was baptized the 15th day of December, 1646." It also gives the marriage information on his parents: ""18 July 1631 Lawrence Pascowe and Mary Verco married.""
2 CONT
2 CONT Perley says Hugh came to Salem, MA, in 1670, living at 14 Beckett St., which house is supposedly still standing.
2 CONT
2 CONT Links
2 CONT * http://genforum.genealogy.com/pascoe/messages/326.html
2 CONT * [http://ianwatson.org/hugh_pasco_7.pdf Descendants of Hugh Pasco] PDF document
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.ianwatson.org/three_mary_peases.pdf (page 4 of the .pdf) has his birth c. 1640-1. It has him deposing as "age 44 in 1685" citing a transcript of the Quarterly Courts of Essex County.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://ma-vitalrecords.org/MA/Essex/Salem/aMarriagesP.shtml "(PASCA (Pasco)) Hugh, and Sara Wooland, 20: 2m: 1670. CTR"
2 CONT
2 CONT (2nd) https://ma-vitalrecords.org/MA/Essex/Salem/aMarriagesP.shtml "(PASCO (Pasca)) Hugh, 2d m., and Mary Pease, Dec. 16, 1678. CTR"
2 CONT
2 CONT Salem VR has Hugh with these children: (under various spellings)
2 CONT * Sarah, d. Hugh and Sara (Wooland), 16: 8m: 1671. married John Hadlock, Jan. 16, 1694. 
2 CONT * Margery, d. Hugh and Sara (Wooland), Mar. 3, 1673.
2 CONT * Mary, d. Hugh and Mary, Oct. 9, 1680. married Nathaniell Tompkins, July 8, 1703.
2 CONT * Elizabeth, d. Hugh and Mary, Aug. 14, 1685.
2 CONT * John, s. Hugh and Mary, July 15, 1689. 
2 CONT * Hannah, d. Hugh and Mary, Mar. 22, 1690.
