1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT From http://spicerweb.org/Genealogy/Pease/peaseregisterlegacy.aspx
2 CONT
2 CONT 28. Jonathan PEASE (John3, Robert2, Robert1) was born on 2 Jan 1669 in Salem, Essex, MA 2 and died on 7 Apr 1721 in Enfield, Hartford Co., CT 2 at age 52. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Jonathan married Elizabeth BOOTH on 11 Oct 1692. Elizabeth was born about 1671 in Saco, York, ME 2 and died on 8 Jan 1723 in Enfield, Hartford Co., CT 2 about age 52. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children from this marriage were:
2 CONT *+ 85 F    i. Rebecca PEASE was born on 22 Jul 1694 in Enfield, Hartford Co., CT.2 
2 CONT *+ 86 M    ii. Jonathan PEASE was born on 17 Apr 1696 and died in Schenectady, Schenectady Co., NY.2 
2 CONT *+ 87 M    iii. David PEASE was born on 21 May 1698 in Enfield, Hartford Co., CT 2 and died on 15 Oct 1758 in Freehold, Monmouth Co., NJ 2 at age 60. 
2 CONT *+ 88 M    iv. Samuel PEASE was born on 12 Oct 1700 in Enfield, Hartford Co., CT.2 
2 CONT *+ 89 M    v. John PEASE was born on 16 Oct 1702 in Enfield, Hartford Co., CT 2 and died on 28 Sep 1725 in Putney, VT at age 22. 
2 CONT *+ 90 M    vi. Josiah PEASE was born on 4 Mar 1706 and died after 1782 in Upton, Worcester, MA.2 
2 CONT *+ 91 M    vii. Pelatiah PEASE was born on 16 Aug 1709 in Enfield, Hartford Co., CT 2 and died on 6 Jul 1769 in Enfield, Hartford Co., CT 2 at age 59. 
2 CONT *+ 92 F    viii. Elizabeth PEASE was born in 1712 in Enfield, Hartford Co., CT 2 and died on 6 Jul 1786 at age 74.
2 CONT
2 CONT One Branch of the Booth Family...138 details the vital info of her parents and their children. (https://books.google.com/books?id=r781AAAAMAAJ&pg=PA138&lpg=PA138&dq=simeon+booth+%26+rebecca+frost&source=bl&ots=LzIgjOLKhC&sig=ACfU3
2 CONC U2HV_gCnL5HAKL9lvEZzidBJoMdfw&hl=en&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwi68YH6vb7hAhUkiOAKHbFBByoQ6AEwCHoECAkQAQ#v=onepage&q=simeon%20booth%20%26%20rebecca%20frost&f=false)
