2 CONT Jacob Phelps was born 7 Feb 1650 in Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut to George Phelps and Frances (Unknown) Phelps. He is the brother of Abigail Phelps [half], Mary (Clark) Strong [half], Thomas Dewey [half], John Dewey [half], Abra
2 CONC ham Phelps [half], Josiah Dewey [half], Anna (Dewey) Woodward [half], Israel Dewey [half], Abigail (Dewey) Cutler [half], Joseph Phelps [half], Jedediah Dewey Sr [half], John Phelps and	Nathaniel Phelps
