1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==The Parents of Hannah Spencer==
2 CONT As of 1/2/2023, the most detailed and cited profile online has this Hannah Spencer as the daughter of Jarred Spencer (https://www.geni.com/people/Jared-Spencer/6000000004079134325?through=6000000007043763425) and Hannah (Pratt) Sp
2 CONC encer (https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Pratt-2686).   This profile, however, is locked to other parents.  Beware.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Spencer-5590
2 CONT
2 CONT Jacobus in The American Genealogist, Vol 27 (1951) p 170 says that Hannah (daughter of Timothy Spencer and wife Sarah Clark) was born c. 1681 and died c. 1705 as a wife of Azariah Dickinson, but no children.  Azariah then married 
2 CONC Mary NN by 1706.
2 CONT
2 CONT But it conflicts with this in Judd, Sylvester, and Lucius M. Boltwood. History of Hadley (Massachusetts): including the early history of Hatfield, South Hadley, Amherst and Granby, Massachusetts. (Springfield, MA: H.R. Huntting & 
2 CONC Co., 1905) 430.
2 CONT Children of Joseph Dickinson and Phebe Bracy: Azariah, b. 15 May 1674, m. (1) Mary ---, m. (2) Elizabeth ---, about 1704 moved to Haddam, CT.
2 CONT
2 CONT This text was not edited 1/2/2023.
2 CONT --------------------------------------------
2 CONT There are other profiles for Hannah which present her parents as a different couple.  Her father is listed as a brother of the man identified here as her father.  See page 151 of "[https://books.google.com/books?id=nSTjzjDkpRUC&pg
2 CONC =PA151&lpg=PA151&dq=thomas+spencer+elizabeth+bates&source=bl&ots=8n3HV5mKx_&sig=daOP9O4FNzQkQU1kEJ9lLJhY4kA&hl=en&sa=X&ved=0CDMQ6AEwBGoVChMI2N_Iifa0yAIVQ6MeCh10egVf#v=onepage&q=thomas%20spencer%20elizabeth%20bates&f=false History 
2 CONC and Families, Anderson County, Kentucky]". It says that her parents were Thomas Spencer, Sr. and Elizabeth Bates, daughter of James Bates and Ann Withington.  The Geni profile for this Elizabeth is [http://www.geni.com/people/Eliz
2 CONC abeth-Bates/6000000000966216014?through=6000000003397188205 here], and her Geni tree is [http://www.geni.com/family-tree/index/6000000000966216014 here].  The parents of Hannah's father are listed as [http://www.geni.com/people/En
2 CONC s-Gerard-Spencer-of-Haddam/6000000006767466007?through=6000000003187924247 Gerard Spencer, Jr.] and [http://www.geni.com/people/Hannah-Spencer/6000000006444481357 Hannah Pratt].
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
