2 CONT 24. ELIZABETH8 MERRILL (ABRAHAM7 +MERRILL, NATHANIEL6 *MERRILL, NATHANIEL5, JOHN4 *MERRELL, THE YOUNGER, JOHN3 *MERYELL, JOHN2, THOMAS1) was born April 26, 1669 in Newbury, Essex, Mass, and died Aft. 1712 in Andover, Mass. She mar
2 CONC ried JOSEPH EMERY October 2, 1693 in Newbury, Essex, Mass, son of JOHN EMERY and MARY WEBSTER. He was born March 23, 1662/63 in Newbury, Essex, Mass, and died September 22, 1721 in Andover, Mass.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of ELIZABETH MERRILL and JOSEPH EMERY are: 
2 CONT 102. i. JOSEPH9 EMERY, b. April 29, 1696, Andover, Mass; d. July 12, 1776, Pembroke, N.H..
2 CONT ii. ELIZABETH EMERY, b. September 28, 1698, Andover, Essex, Mass; d. Unknown; m. ROBERT PEASE, Bef. 1724; b. February 2, 1682/83, Enfield, Hartford, Conn; d. November 17, 1766, Enford, HArtford, Conn.
2 CONT
