2 CONT [Christopher Parsons was the son of Benjamin Parsons Born 15 September 1658 Springfield Hampshire Massachusetts Bay Colony died 22 December 1728 Enfield, Hartford Co., Connecticut Colony. He married 17 January 1683 in Springfield 
2 CONC Hampshire Massachusetts bay Colony Sarah Keep, born 5 Dec 1666 and she died 22 December 1728 Enfield, Hartford, Connecticut Colony. You should connects Christopher Parsons (also called Christopher Dudley Parsons) to his father Ben
2 CONC jamin Find a grave #168948206. You seems to have the wrong dates for Christopher. IGI gives birth date as 28 january 1691 Enfield, Hartford Connecticut Colony.
2 CONT Contributor: Shirl Hering (48777241)]
2 CONT
