1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/25613158/asahel-parsons
2 CONT
2 CONT aged 68
2 CONT
2 CONT Inscription
2 CONT In memory of
2 CONT Mr, ASAHEL PARSONS
2 CONT who was born Dec. 11, 1747
2 CONT & died May 31. 1816
2 CONT aged 68.
2 CONT Also his wife
2 CONT Mrs. ABIGAIL
2 CONT she was born Jan 29, 1752
2 CONT & died May 3, 1802
2 CONT aged 50.
2 CONT
2 CONT Some hearty friend shall drop a tear,
2 CONT On our dry bones and say,
2 CONT These once were strong as mine appear,
2 CONT And mine must as they,
2 CONT Thus shall our mouldering Members teach,
2 CONT What now our Senses learn,
2 CONT For dust and ashes loudest preach,
2 CONT Man's infinite concern.
