1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Hannah Warriner was born on 10 Sep 1674 in Hadley Or Northfield, MA and died in Enfield, Hartford Co., CT. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the daughter of Joseph Warriner & Mary Montague.
2 CONT
2 CONT Hannah married Robert Pease Jr. on December 24, 1691 in Hadley, Massachusetts (some have in Enfield, Hartford, CT)  
2 CONT
2 CONT 11 children from this marriage were:
2 CONT * + 42 F    i. Hannah PEASE was born on 25 Mar 1692 in Enfield, Hartford Co., CT.2 
2 CONT * + 43 F    ii. Mary PEASE was born on 19 Dec 1695 in Enfield, Hartford Co., CT.2 
2 CONT * + 44 F    iii. Sarah PEASE was born on 25 May 1698 in Enfield, Hartford Co., CT.2 
2 CONT * + 45 M    iv. Nathaniel PEASE was born on 3 Oct 1700 in Enfield, Hartford Co., CT 2 and died in Stephentown, NY.2 
2 CONT * + 46 F    v. Experience PEASE was born on 4 Aug 1701 in Enfield, Hartford Co., CT.2 
2 CONT * + 47 F    vi. Abigail PEASE was born on 27 Mar 1705 in Enfield, Hartford Co., CT.2 
2 CONT * + 48 M    vii. Joseph PEASE was born on 3 Aug 1707 in Enfield, Hartford Co., CT.2 
2 CONT * + 49 F    viii. Bethia PEASE was born on 21 Nov 1709 in Enfield, Hartford Co., CT.2 
2 CONT * + 50 F    ix. Miriam PEASE was born in Oct 1711 in Enfield, Hartford Co., CT.2 
2 CONT * + 51 F    x. Jemima PEASE was born in Oct 1712 in Enfield, Hartford Co., CT.2 
2 CONT * + 52 M    xi. Benjamin PEASE was born on 1 Oct 1718 in Enfield, Hartford Co., CT 2 and died on 17 Jan 1781 in Enfield, Hartford Co., CT 2 at age 62. 
2 CONT
