2 CONT He was a newspaper writer in New York state for several papers over his career.  He was one of the first circuit judges in Ingham County, Michigan.  He was 63 years old when he died in a town called "Jefferson" in Ingham County, M
2 CONC ichigan, which was a short-lived community that no longer exists.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/114162035/william-child Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Dec 1
