2 CONT
2 CONT Isaac Bartholomew, son of William Bartholomew and Mary Johnson, was born in Roxbury, November 1, 1664, died in Branford. October 25, 1727. He was a practical and successful farmer and a highly respected citizen. About 1694 he marr
2 CONC ied Rebecca, born November 14, 1679, died May, 1738, daughter of John Frisbie. Children: William, born about 1695; Mary, about 1697; Isaac. November 18, 1699; Rebecca, April 18, 1702; Elizabeth, April 12, 1704; Ebenezer, June 10, 
2 CONC 1706; Abraham, mentioned below: Josiah, January 18, 1710; Abigail; Freelove; Jerusha, January 13, 1722-23.  One of the early landowners of Woodstock, CT where several of his children were born.
2 CONT
