1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Abigail Bartholomew Paine=
2 CONT * BIRTH 6 Dec 1672 Branford New Haven County Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * DEATH 13 Jan 1752 (aged 79) Woodstock, Windham County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * BURIAL Woodstock Hill Cemetery, Woodstock, Windham County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * MEMORIAL ID 7997328 photos added by Nikita Barlow
2 CONT
2 CONT Abigail Bartholomew was christened on Dec 8,1672, the daughter of Lieut. William Bartholomew and Mary Johnson Bartholomew of Hatfield,MA.  As a child, Abigail and several other people were captured during the Indian raid on Hatfie
2 CONC ld, MA, taken to Canada on Sep 19,1677 and held captive for several months by the Indians. All were ransomed for £200.  Twice married, twice widowed, and the mother/stepmother of a large family abigail raised before dying "in the 
2 CONC 80th year of her age".
2 CONT
2 CONT Shortly after her 18th birthday she married her 1st husband Joseph Frissell on Jan 11,1691/2 at Woodstock,CT. This was one of the earliest marriages there. Joseph was the son of James Frissell and Mary Busketh Frissell. During the
2 CONC ir 13-year marriage they had 9 children together before he died on May 13,1704.  Widowed in her early thirties, she married again within five years 2nd husband, Samuel Paine, a widower with several children, on Jan 18,1708/9 in Wo
2 CONC odstock,CT.  The mature newlyweds' blended family was later increased by two children born of this second marriage. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Abigails slate stele gravestone is extraordinary in that it features neither a winged death's head nor a soul effigy in its tympanum, but a clock with Roman numerals, its hands at the Roman numerals XII and VI. Like the pick and s
2 CONC hovel and the crossed bones images which also adorn her stone, the clock is a mortality symbol akin to the more commonly seen hourglass.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Inscription'''
2 CONT "Here lies the Body of
2 CONT Mrs. ABIGAIL PAINE
2 CONT Relict Widow of
2 CONT Mr. SAMUEL PAINE
2 CONT She Died Jan. ye 13th
2 CONT 1752 in the 80th
2 CONT Year of Her Age"
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Parents'''
2 CONT William Bartholomew 1640–1697
2 CONT Mary Johnson Bartholomew 1642–1705
2 CONT
