2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT Mary was born in 1677 to  William Barthlomew III and Mary (Johnson) Barthlomew.  She married an early settler in Coventry, Rhode Island, Elkanah Johnson, 1695 in Coventry, Kent, Rhode.  They had 7 children together before she pass
2 CONC ed away in 1749 at the age of 71 - 72.
