1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Joseph Bartholomew=
2 CONT * BIRTH 1682 Branford, New Haven County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * DEATH 15 Oct 1724 (aged 41–42) Woodstock, Windham County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * BURIAL Woodstock Hill Cemetery, Woodstock, Windham County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * Latitude: 41.9492186, Longitude: -71.9733306
2 CONT * MEMORIAL ID 47811988 photos added by Laura W. Petix & Joe, Info submitted by Sunny Gates
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph and his wife Elizabeth died on the same day on October 15, 1724, probably as the result of a fire sweeping through their house according to researchers. They left six children under the age of ten.  There children were all 
2 CONC born in Woodstock, Windham, CT: Samuel Bartholomew born November 1714; Joseph (II) Bartholomew born February 1716; Jedediah Bartholomew born October 1717; Mary Bartholomew born February 1719 (or October 1718); John Bartholomew bor
2 CONC n March 1720; and Benjamin Bartholomew born June 1723.
2 CONT
