1 NOTE {geni:about_me} There is conflicting information about his birth.
2 CONT
2 CONT According to one source (http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~cbarth67/d40.htm#P69), John was born on July 17, 1650.
2 CONT
2 CONT According to the Frisbie family records that resided in Belding, Michigan, he was born in 1644.
2 CONT
2 CONT John was born in Branford, New Haven Co., CT. He died in Mar 1693 or 1694 in Branford, New Haven Co., CT.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was married to Ruth Bowers on Dec 2, 1674 in Branford, New Haven Co., CT. John's children were: John Frisbie, Edward Frisbie, Rebecca Frisbie, Nathaniel Frisbie, Hannah Frisbie, Samuel Frisbie, Ruth Frisbie, Joseph Frisbie, and
2 CONC  Lydia Frisbie.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT  John Frisbie was born on 17 July 1650 at Branford, New Haven, Connecticut.2,3,4 He was the son of Edward Frisbie and Hannah Culpepper. John Frisbie married Ruth Bowers, daughter of Rev. John Bowers and Rebecca Gregson, on 2 Decem
2 CONC ber 1674 at Branford, New Haven, Connecticut.5,3,4 John Frisbie died in March 1694 at Branford, Connecticut, at age 43.4  
2 CONT
2 CONT      Children of John Frisbie and Ruth Bowers: 
2 CONT
2 CONT John Frisbie   b. 22 May 1676, d. 14 Jan 1736 
2 CONT
2 CONT Edward Frisbie+   b. 24 Jan 1677/78, d. 13 Dec 1741 
2 CONT
2 CONT Rebecca Frisbie   b. 14 Nov 1679, d. 18 May 1738 
2 CONT
2 CONT Hannah Frisbie   b. 18 Jan 1682, d. 2 Dec 1741 
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel Frisbie   b. 10 Feb 1683, d. 1690 
2 CONT
2 CONT Ruth Frisbie   b. 6 Sep 1685, d. 25 May 1688 
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph Frisbie   b. 5 Aug 1688, d. 26 Apr 1758 
2 CONT
2 CONT Lydia Frisbie   b. 1693, d. 30 Jan 1750 
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Customer Pedigree, World Family Tree Vol. 5, Tree #2881
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Descendants of Richard Frisbie, John David Feagin. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Compiled by Hon. Ralph D. Smyth, "Edward Frisbie of Branford". 
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. Donald Lines Jacobus, Ancient New Haven, p. 626, Frisbie. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. Unknown subject unknown repository, 3585. 
2 CONT
