1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ruth Bowers was baptized on 20 December 1657 at First Congregational Church, New Haven, Connecticut.3,4 She was the daughter of Rev. John Bowers and Rebecca Gregson. Ruth Bowers married John Frisbie, son of Edward 
2 CONC Frisbie and Hannah Culpepper, on 2 December 1674 at Branford, New Haven, Connecticut. Married 2) William Hoadley as his 3rd wife. Ruth Bowers died on 26 April 1736 at Branford, Connecticut, at age 78.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Ruth Bowers and John Frisbie:
2 CONT
2 CONT     John Frisbie   b. 22 May 1676, d. 14 Jan 1736
2 CONT
2 CONT     Edward Frisbie+   b. 24 Jan 1677/78, d. 13 Dec 1741
2 CONT
2 CONT     Rebecca Frisbie   b. 14 Nov 1679, d. 18 May 1738
2 CONT
2 CONT     Hannah Frisbie   b. 18 Jan 1682, d. 2 Dec 1741
2 CONT
2 CONT     Samuel Frisbie   b. 10 Feb 1683, d. 1690
2 CONT
2 CONT     Ruth Frisbie   b. 6 Sep 1685, d. 25 May 1688
2 CONT
2 CONT     Joseph Frisbie   b. 5 Aug 1688, d. 26 Apr 1758
2 CONT
2 CONT     Lydia Frisbie   b. 1693, d. 30 Jan 1750 
2 CONT
