1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Edward Frisbie was born on 24 January 1677/78 at Branford, New Haven, Connecticut.3,2,4 He was the son of John Frisbie and Ruth Bowers. Edward Frisbie married Martha Pardee, daughter of George Pardee and Mercy Ball
2 CONC , on 30 December 1702 at Branford, New Haven, Connecticut.4 Edward Frisbie died on 13 December 1741 at Branford, New Haven, Connecticut, at age 63.3,4  
