2 CONT
2 CONT Edwasd Frisbie 1620-5/10/1690 Bradford, CT was the s/o Richard Frisbie and Margaret Emerson. Paul Herbig said Edward Frisbie married Hannah Culpepper, d/o John Culpepper. Their son John married Ruth Bowers.
