1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Abigail Brown Bartholomew=
2 CONT * BIRTH 1705 Milford, New Haven County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * DEATH Aug 1726 (aged 20–21) New Haven County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * BURIAL New Center Cemetery, North Haven, New Haven County, Connecticut, USA 
2 CONT * MEMORIAL ID  198584028 -by Gayle (47223271) 4-9-24 with death month and parent links.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT Abigail Brown Bartholomew was born in 1705 Milford, New Haven County, Connecticut to Gersham Brown and Hannah Mansfield the 4th of five with other siblings being Eleazer; Sarah; Hannah; and Olive.  She married William Bartholomew,
2 CONC  s/o Andrew Bartholomew and Hannah Frisbie, on 25 Jan 1721/22 by Rev. Jacob Heminway and had 2 Children: Gersham b 1 Dec 1722; and Abigail b 23 Jan 1724 with him.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Parents'''
2 CONT Gershom Brown 1665–1724
2 CONT Hannah Mansfield Brown 1669–1726
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Spouse'''
2 CONT William Bartholomew 1699–1734 (m. 1721)
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Siblings'''
2 CONT Eliezer Brown 1696–1768
2 CONT Olive Brown Browne 1708–1743
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children'''
2 CONT Gershom Bartholomew 1722–1764
