1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT Elizabeth was born 16 Feb 1688 [1] the daughter of Jared Spencer and Hannah Pratt. Elizabeth is a twin to Sarah.
2 CONT
2 CONT On 15 Mar. 1711/2, Jared Spencer of Hartford wrote his will. I give to my 4 daughters Hannah, Sarah, Elizabeth and Mary, to each of them, 10 pounds over and besides what my daughter Hannah formerly received of me.
2 CONT
