2 CONT
2 CONT 	i.	MARY2 CATLIN, b. Abt. 1646.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for MARY CATLIN:
2 CONT
2 CONT --this is the Mary who is supposed to have married Joseph Churchill.  I assume it is an error - but--
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.	ii.	JOHN CATLIN, b. 1647.
2 CONT
2 CONT 	iii.	MARY CATLIN, b. Abt. 1649; m. JOSEPH CHURCHILL; b. 02 Dec 1649, Wethersfield, Connecticut; d. 01 Apr 1699.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for MARY CATLIN:
2 CONT
2 CONT The Origin of the Churchill Family
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph born---married Mary Toucey May 13, 1674. They had nine children,<nowiki>----</nowiki>.
2 CONT
2 CONT Generation No. 2
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.  JOHN2 CATLIN (THOMAS1) was born 1647.  He married MARY MARSHALL 27 Jul 1665 in Hartford, Hartford, Connecticut1,2, daughter of SAMUEL MARSHALL.  She died 20 Oct 1716 in Hartford.
