2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for MARY CATLIN:
2 CONT
2 CONT --died young according to one source.
2 CONT
2 CONT --may have married Thomas French;
2 CONT
2 CONT --married Thomas French? married John Burnham?
2 CONT
2 CONT --born 10 July?
2 CONT
2 CONT 3.	ii.	SAMUEL CATLIN, b. 04 Nov 1673; d. 01 Dec 1760.
2 CONT
