2 CONT
2 CONT 3.  SAMUEL3 CATLIN (JOHN2, THOMAS1) was born 04 Nov 1673, and died 01 Dec 1760.  He married (1) ELIZABETH NORTON 05 Jan 1702 in Hartford, Hartford, Connecticut3, daughter of JOHN NORTON and RUTH MOORE/MORE.  She was born Abt. 1678
2 CONC , and died 14 Aug 1724.  He married (2) SARAH NICHOLS 13 May 1725, daughter of CYPRIAN NICHOLS and HELEN.  She was born Abt. 1677, and died 12 Dec 1762.
2 CONT
