2 CONT
2 CONT In Memory of 
2 CONT Mr. Benjamin Hall 
2 CONT & Susanna Hall his consort. 
2 CONT He died Dec. 11, 1806 
2 CONT She died Dec. 2, 1779 
2 CONT ''They were indulgent, kind 
2 CONT and affectionate parents.''
