2 CONT
2 CONT ibid., vol. I Donald Lines Jacobus pp. 60–63, 90.
2 CONT
2 CONT ibid., vol. VI Donald Lines Jacobus p. 1494.
2 CONT
2 CONT Genealogical Register of the Descendants in the Male Line of David Atwater, One of the Original Planters of New Haven, Conn., to the Sixth Generation, 1873.
2 CONT
