1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Families of Ancient New Haven by Donald Lines Jacobus, pg.  60
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 1625 in New Haven, CT; Died 1 Apr 1691 in New Haven, CT
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of Thomas Sayre b. 20 Jul 1597 in Leighton, Bedfordshire, Eng.; d. 23 Apr 1671 in Southampton, Suffolk, NY and Margaret Aldrich b. 1600 in Leighton, Bed, Eng.; d. 1600 in Leighton, Bed. Eng., d. 23 Aug 1634 in Lynn, South
2 CONC ampton, LI, NY
2 CONT
2 CONT From DAR Lineage Book, Vol. 1, 1890-91, p. 990, Sayre (Sayer, Sayres), Thomas (bap. 1597 - 1670) from England, first recorded at Lynn, Mass 1638, a founder of Southampton, L. I. 1640; where he built a house still standing, served 
2 CONC as a scout against the Indians at Southampton.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT 16 September, 1669: named in her father's will:
2 CONT
2 CONT "5th. I give unto my daughter Damaris Atwater ffourty Shillings."
2 CONT
2 CONT Not much is known about Damaris other than she was a young girl of 12 or 13 when her father decided that the Americas would be a better place for his family. She is named on her father's will of 1669 as "Damaris Atwater' and she r
2 CONC aised a family of 10 children, dying after a 45 year marriage only a year and a half before her husband.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.myheritage.com/research/record-1-188834052-2-16451/damaris-atwater-born-sayre-in-myheritage-family-trees MyHeritage Family Trees] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jun 15 2019
2 CONC , 16:06:00 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.myheritage.com/research/record-1-452781061-1-501425/damaris-atwater-born-sayre-in-myheritage-family-trees MyHeritage Family Trees] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jun 16 201
2 CONC 9, 17:12:18 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT ~MY ANCESTOR~
2 CONT
2 CONT The daughter of THOMAS & MARGARET (ALDRICH) SAYRE, she married DAVID ATWATER on March 10, 1647/48 in New Haven, Conn.  They lived in the Cedar Hill region of New Haven.
2 CONT
2 CONT Their children:  Mercy (Mary) Atwater Austin, Damaris (Atwater) Punderson, David Atwater, Joshua Atwater, John Atwater, JONATHAN ATWATER (MY ANCESTOR), Abigail (Atwater) Jones, Mary (Atwater) Stowe Robinson, Samuel Atwater, Ebenez
2 CONC er Atwater.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/29871352/damaris-atwater Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jun 15 2019, 18:42:46 UTC''
