1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Mercy (Glover) Mansfield''' was born before August 16, 1643 in New Haven, New Haven Colony, Colonial America and baptized there on August 16, 1643. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-46555267 Henry Glover, of New Ha
2 CONC ven] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-14241329 Helena (unknown) Glover]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mercy married [https://www.geni.com/profile-24761143 Major Moses Mansfield] on May 5, 1664 in New Haven.
2 CONT
2 CONT Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-43418083 Richard Mansfield]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-36478560 Abigail (Mansfield) Atwater]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34661102794 Samuel Mansfield];
2 CONC  [https://www.geni.com/profile-43418084 Bathshua (Mansfield) Chapman]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-36477716 Mercy (Mansfield) Thompson]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-43418081 Capt. Moses Mansfield]; [https://www.geni.com/profil
2 CONC e-33946675 Sarah (Mansfield) Allen]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-43608396 Jonathan Glover Mansfield]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-24762771 Hannah (Mansfield) Brown]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in 1694 in Possibly New Haven, New Haven County, Connecticut Colony, Colonial America. 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Mentioned on page 182 https://archive.org/details/genealogyofcowle00cowl/page/n391/mode/2up
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Families of Ancient New Haven by Donald Lines Jacobus, pg. 60, 346, 660, 1137
2 CONT
