1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Joshua Hall, the son of Thomas Hall and Abigail Atwater, was born 23 May 1722 and died in 1810. On the 1790 census he was in Wallingford (1-0-2). He married Hannah Hall, the daughter of Samuel Hall and Hannah Brown
2 CONC , who was born 2 June 1725. They had 7 children: Susanna, Abigail, Giles, Samuel, Mary, Hannah, and Joshua.[1]
2 CONT
