1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Grandson of John Atwater an early Wallingford settler. Son of Joshua and Sarah Yale Atwater. His first wife was Abigail Jones, second wife was Ruth Wadsworth. 8 children: Sarah, Mary, Lucy, Joshua, James, Abigail, 
2 CONC Catherine & Ruth.
2 CONT
2 CONT He apprenticed as a shoe and harness maker and tanner of leather. Successful merchant who paid cash for extensive lands in the Western Reserve or New Connecticut in Ohio. Member of the Congregational Church.
2 CONT
2 CONT [His mother Sarah (nee Yale) was the second wife of Capt. Joshua Atwater, Esq. _m. Sept. 4, 1740.  Sarah Yale was D/O Capt. Theophilus Yale (1675-1760) and Sarah (Street) Yale d. Nov. 28, 1784.  One known son was Joshua Atwater]
2 CONT
