1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The daughter of Deacon Eliasaph & Mary, Mary Preston married (1) Caleb Merriman on July 9, 1690 in Wallingford, Conn. and (2) Samuel Munson on March 10, 1707/8.
2 CONT
