2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Preston-46
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Preston was the daughter of Dea. Eliasaph Preston and his first wife Mary _____ Preston.
2 CONT
2 CONT Her birth date is problematic. Families of Ancient New Haven states she was born 12 April 1674 recorded in Stratford, Connecticut or 24 April 1674 recorded in Wallingford, Connecticut.[1] However the printed indexed versions say s
2 CONC he was born April last 1674 in the Stratford records.[2]. The Wallingford printed records list the birth as 28 April 1674.[3] Mary Preston married Caleb Merriman, July 9, 1690, by Theo[philus] Yale in Wallingford.[4]
2 CONT
2 CONT The children of Caleb and Mary were born in Wallingford.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Moses Merriman Moses was born 31 October 1691[1][4]
2 CONT # Elizabeth was born 4 May 1693[1][4]
2 CONT # Elliasaph was born 20 May 1695[1][4]
2 CONT # Hannah was born 10 September 1697[1][4]
2 CONT # Phebe was born 11 September 1699[1] or 12 Dec 1699[4]
2 CONT # Lydia was born 8 September 1701 and died soon[1] b. Dec [ ][4]
2 CONT # Lydia was born 12 November 1702[1][4]
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Merriman married Samuel Munson 10 Mar 1708 by Justice Hall.[3]
2 CONT
2 CONT The children of Samuel and Mary (Preston) Munson born in Wallingford.[1][4]
2 CONT
2 CONT # Lemuel Munson, b. 5 Feb 1709[1][4]
2 CONT # Merriman Munson, b. 30 Nov 1710[1][4]
2 CONT # Mamre Munson, b. 16 Dec 1712[1][4]
2 CONT # Lent Munson, b. 16 Nov 1714[1][4]
2 CONT # Mary Munson died 28 Nov 1755.[1][4]
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
