1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Lydia Merriman Cook=
2 CONT * BIRTH 12 Nov 1702 Wallingford, New Haven County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * DEATH 25 Dec 1785 (aged 83)
2 CONT * BURIAL Hillside Cemetery, Cheshire, New Haven County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * Latitude: 41.4965595, Longitude: -72.8989114
2 CONT * MEMORIAL ID 27986076 photos added by Earl Hudson & CT Graver
2 CONT
2 CONT Lydia Merriman Cook was born in Wallingford, Connecticut on 12 November 1702, the daughter of Caleb and Mary Preston Merriman, wife of Capt. Ephraim Cook.
2 CONT
