2 CONT Children 1) Rebecca Griswold Yale 3/13/1787, married Noah Parsons, Lima New York, 3 Children; Ann Amelia 1823 married Addison Chamberlain in 1846, Harriet Newell 1825, married Andrew J Warner in 1846 2) Dr. Asahel 12/4/1788 physic
2 CONC ian in Sodus, New York 3) Noah 3/4/1791, farmer in Williamson, Wayne County, New York, married Diana Nichols 4) Sarah 1795, married Alfred Bailey of Meridan, Connecticut June 1816. three children; Hiram died 1842, Asahel, Harriet.
2 CONC  Moved to Richmond, McComb Cty Michigan 5) Maria 3/2/1800; married Webster Groves 1827; 6 children, moved to Troy Ohio 6) Katurah 2/9/1802 married Henry Hunt of Aurelius 1835; 2 children 7) Hiram died in infancy 8) Joel 1/14/1808
