1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The October 8, 1673 marriage in Middletown, Connecticut of Josiah Adkins and Elizabeth Wethmer/Whitmore  is recorded in Torrey's New England Marriages Prior to 1700.  He gives Josiah Akins' date of death as 1690 an
2 CONC d Elizabeth Wetmore's as 1700.  Torrey notes "calls Nathaniel Stowe brother".
2 CONT
2 CONT Josiah was apparently married first to Elizabeth Andrews (?) who died in 1669 (?).  They had a son, Samuel, born in 1651.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Josiah's widow died about 1700 Josiah the father died Sep 12 1690
2 CONT
2 CONT Children with Elizabeth Andrews (?): 
2 CONT # Samuel, b 1851 or 1860.  He married as her second husband Esther (Welch) Fenn of Milford, CT in 1693.
2 CONT
