2 CONT Brief Life History of Rachel
2 CONT
2 CONT When Rachel Hall was born on 29 August 1731, in Enfield, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, her father, Nicholas Hall, was 41 and her mother, Rachel Gary, was 31. She married Isaac Pease III on 13 January 1748, in
2 CONC  Enfield, Hartford, Connecticut Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 3 daughters. She died on 13 January 1786, in Enfield, Hartford, Connecticut, United States, at the age of 54, and was b
2 CONC uried in Enfield Street Cemetery, Enfield, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America.
