2 CONT When Isaac Pease IV was born on 14 June 1753, in Enfield, Hartford, Connecticut, United States, his father, Isaac Pease III, was 24 and his mother, Rachel Hall, was 21. He had at least 3 sons and 4 daughters with Dorcas Pease. He 
2 CONC registered for military service in 1831. He died in 1842, in Ohio, United States, at the age of 89.
