2 CONT
2 CONT Private Gowdy enlisted in the Second Regiment of the Connecticut line.  He served in various regiments until 1778 and 1779 when he went out as a substitute for his father, again in the Connecticut regiments. He was pensioned for h
2 CONC is service.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Alice GLEASON and moved to Martinsburg, NY.
2 CONT
