1 NOTE {geni:about_me}       448. Samuel Frost, born 1703 in New Haven, New Haven, CT.. He was the son of 896. John Frost and 897. Mercy Paine. He married 449. Naomi Fenn March 21, 1733 in Wallingford, New Haven County, Connecticut. 
2 CONT
2 CONT       449. Naomi Fenn, born May 10, 1712 in Wallingford, New Haven County, Connecticut; died April 07, 1746 in Waterbury, New Haven, CT. She was the daughter of 898. Edward Fenn and 899. Mary Thorpe. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Samuel Frost and Naomi Fenn are: 
2 CONT  	224	i.	 	Samuel Frost, born February 01, 1736; married Sarah Cooper March 15, 1759 in New Haven CT..
2 CONT  		ii.	 	Moses Frost, born January 06, 1734.
2 CONT  		iii.	 	Naomi Frost, born March 31, 1735.
