1 NAME Thomas /Judd/
2 GIVN Thomas
2 SURN Judd
2 _MARNM Judd
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE BEF 13 OCT 1662
2 ADDR
3 CITY Farmington
3 STAE Connecticut Colony
3 CTRY (Present USA)
1 DEAT
2 DATE 24 AUG 1724
2 ADDR
3 CITY Hartford
3 STAE Province of Connecticut
3 CTRY (Present USA)
1 OCCU Esq., Blacksmith/farmer
1 TITL Capt.
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Families of Ancient New Haven by Donald Lines Jacobus, pg. 636
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas Judd and His Descendants by Sylvester Judd, pg. 37, 38
2 CONT
2 CONT "He was a Deputy to the General Court from Waterbury, five or six times, and his cousin, Deac. Thomas Judd, was a Deputy with him from W. at five sessions.  He must have been a school teacher, for he is sometimes called in deeds, 
2 CONC Thomas Judd, schoolmaster.  He purchased or inherited a large farm in Farmington, next to the Hartford line, and he removed from Waterbury to this farm around 1709.  He afterwards bought land in Hartford, adjoining his farm, and h
2 CONC e build on his Hartford land and lived in West Hartford until his death, Aug. 24, 1724.  His home farm and two houses and other buildings, were appraised at L410, and he had other lands, and gave land to each of his daughters.  Hi
2 CONC s children were all born in Waterbury, except the youngest.  His age was not far from 61.
2 CONT
2 CONT This Thomas Judd, his brother John Judd, and his cousin Deac. Thomas Judd, and William Judd, son of the latter, each held the office of Town Clerk of Waterbury, between 1696 and 1720.  The penmanship of one or two of them is awkwa
2 CONC rd."
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT ===Family 
2 CONT Thomas had one son and five daughters who survived him. A son and daughter died in their childhood, and another daughter died at age 28. Lived in Waterbury. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas Judd, Esq. m. 2-9-1688 to Sarah Gaylord.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT # Elizabeth Howe (born Judd)
2 CONT # Sarah Williams (born Judd)
2 CONT # Mary Moss (born Judd)
2 CONT # Joseph Judd
2 CONT # Ebenezer Judd
2 CONT # Joseph Judd
2 CONT # Abigail Hall (born Judd)
2 CONT # Thomas Judd, IV
2 CONT # Johannah Scot (born Judd)
2 CONT # Rachel Judd
2 CONT # 
