2 CONT
2 CONT Mary, daughter  of Thomas Judd and Sarah Gaylord, born Apr 2 1706 at  Waterbury, New Haven, Connecticut.  Died Jan 28 1748 at  Wallingford, New Haven, Connecticut.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family 
2 CONT Samuel Moss was born in 1711. He was the son of Samuel Moss and Susannah Hall. He married Mary Judd in 1735 and they had 7 children. Nine days after Mary gave birth to Theophilius, Mary died. Four days after Mary's death, the baby
2 CONC  died. With 6 children to raise, Samuel found a widow to marry and they had 6 additional children. Samuel died in September of 1791, at the age of 80.
