2 CONT Jerusha Morrison Hill Searle's parents were Leonard Hill and Sarah (Sally) Forbush. She married John Courtland Searle 20 Mar 1850 in Salt Lake City, Salt Lake, Utah. They were the parents of twelve children. Their 3rd child, Sarah
2 CONC  Ann Searle Nielsen (#31806861 - no link) is buried in Payson. See the link to their 6th child, Luna, in Basalt, Idaho, cemetery.
