1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Hope Parker
2 CONT *Born 26 Apr 1650 in New Haven, New Haven, Connecticut
2 CONT *Died before 1690 in prob Wallingford, New Haven, Connecticut
2 CONT *Daughter of Edward Parker and Elizabeth (unknown) Rose
2 CONT *Wife of Samuel Cook Sr — married 2 May 1667 in New Haven, Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Samuel Cook by 1st Marriage to Hope Parker:
2 CONT *1 Samuel, b March 3, 1667-8, in New Haven ; 
2 CONT *2 John, b Dec. 3, 1669, in New Haven; 
2 CONT *3 Hannah, b March 3,1671-2, in Wallingford ; 
2 CONT *4 Isaac, b March 10, 1673, d April 7, 1673;
2 CONT * 5 Mary, b April 23, 1675, m Nathaniel Ives, April 5, 1699; 
2 CONT *6 Elizabeth, b August 22, 1677, d young; 
2 CONT *7 Judith, b Feb. 29, 1679, m Jeremiah How jr., April 20, 1704, she d March 20, 1708 ; 
2 CONT *8 Isaac, b Jan. 10, 1681;  [Note: The birthdate does not match the Barbour VRs. “p 91 - Isack, s. Sam[ue]ll, b. 10th, seventh, 1673/4 - Vol PR, p 15”]
2 CONT *9 Joseph, b Feb. 25, 1683 ; 
2 CONT *10 Hope, b Sept. 27, 1686, m Joseph Benham, Dec. 18, 1706, she d Jan. 30, 1731. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References
2 CONT *History of Wallingford, Conn. by Charles Henry Stanley Davis Genealogies - Part 1, pg. 672, 673 [https://archive.org/details/historyofwalling00daviiala/page/672 Archive.Org]
2 CONT *Families of Ancient New Haven by Donald Lines Jacobus, pg. 190, 435
2 CONT * https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Parker-455
2 CONT *https://funwithfamilyhistory.files.wordpress.com/2012/08/046-chapter4-book-of-gideon.pdf
