1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Isaac Curtis==
2 CONT * Birth:	June 17 1658 - Dorchester, Suffolk, MA
2 CONT * Death:	July 15 1712 - Wallingford, New Haven, CT
2 CONT * Parents:	Richard Curtis, Sarah Howe
2 CONT * Wife:	Sarah Foote
2 CONT * Children:	Isaac Curtis, Joseph Curtis, Ebenezer Curtis, Stephen Curtis, Elizabeth Curtis, Benjamin Curtis, Sarah Lewis
2 CONT
2 CONT ==descent includes==
2 CONT
2 CONT Rutherford Birchard HAYES (1822-1893), 19th U. S. President, Gov. of Ohio, Brig. General, and attorney, married Lucy Ware 'Lemonade Lucy' WEBB (1831-1889), 16th First Lady.
2 CONT
2 CONT * James WEBB (1795-1833) and Marietta 'Maria' COOK (1805-1866)
2 CONT * Isaac COOK IV (1768-1844) and Margaretta SCOTT (1772-1833)
2 CONT * Isaac COOK III (1739-1810) and Martha COOK (b. 1741)
2 CONT * Isaac COOK II (1711-1780) and Jerusha SEXTON (d. 1795) [see below]
2 CONT * Isaac COOK I (1681-1712) and Sarah CURTIS (1685-1770)
2 CONT * Isaac CURTIS (1647-1712) and Sarah FOOTE (b. 1662)
2 CONT * Robert FOOTE (c1627-1681) and Sarah POTTER (b. 1639)
2 CONT * Nathaniel FOOTE (c1593-1644) and Elizabeth DEMING (c1595-1683)   
2 CONT --------
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: Paul Herbig. email: prfssrpah@aol.com Married 11 Aug 1682 Sarah Foote.
2 CONT
