1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Sarah Foote==
2 CONT *  Born on 12 Feb 1661[/2] in New Haven, CT.
2 CONT * died after 1714 (date unknown)
2 CONT * daughter of Lieut. Robert Foote & Sarah Potter
2 CONT
2 CONT On 13 Aug 1682 when Sarah was 20, she first married Isaac Curtis, son of Richard Curtis (ca 1611-17 Sep 1681) & Sarah [Strange], in Wallingford, CT.31 Born on 17 Jun 1658 in Dorchester, MA.30 Isaac died in Wallingford, CT, on 15 J
2 CONC ul 1712; he was 54.31
2 CONT
2 CONT Their children include:
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Isaac and Sarah (Foote) Curtis:
2 CONT
2 CONT *     i. Isaac Curtis, b. 6 Nov 1683;
2 CONT *     ii. Sarah Curtis, b. 11 Jun 1685;
2 CONT *     iii. Joseph Curtis, b. 11 Jul 1689;
2 CONT *     iv. Ebenezer Curtis, b. 6 Oct 1691, d. 20 Jul 1717;
2 CONT *     v. Stephen Curtis, b. 8 Mar 1694;
2 CONT *     vi. Phebe Curtis, died. 5 Aug 1718;
2 CONT *     vii. John Curtis, b. 1698, d. 20 Jul 1719;
2 CONT *     viii. Elizabeth Curtis, b. 10 Aug 1701; and
2 CONT *     ix. Benjamin Curtis, b. 2 Mar 1703.
2 CONT
2 CONT On 9 Aug 1714 when Sarah was 52, she second married Nathaniel How, son of Jeremy How (1614-16 Jan 1690/1) & Elizabeth [How] (-23 Jan 1695/6), in Wallingford, CT.31 Nathaniel died on 12 Feb 1723 in Wallingford, CT.31
2 CONT
2 CONT ------
2 CONT
2 CONT * source: 74. “New Haven Vital Records.”Sarah Foote. Born on 12 Feb 1661[/2] in New Haven, CT.74
