2 CONT # Reference: [https://books.google.com/books?id=6XDUfP9d_OgC&pg=PA160&lpg=PA160&dq=Lewis+Beecher+Thompson&source=bl&ots=mva4V2MNF8&sig=IHUo8xwaWvRlKeZi8pDx__q4wkA&hl=en&sa=X&ved=0ahUKEwibyaOA4JTLAhUBE2MKHR1GBFIQ6AEIJjAD#v=onepage&
2 CONC q=Lewis%20Beecher%20Thompson&f=false Google]
2 CONT
