2 CONT
2 CONT 1. DANIEL1 BRAINERD is said to have been born in Braintree, Essex, England in 1641. To my knowledge
2 CONT that has not been confirmed with any documentation. He married (1) HANNAH SPENCER about 1663 in
2 CONT Haddam, CT. He married (2) ELIZABETH (WAKEMAN)ARNOLD March 30,1693, dau. of Samuel
2 CONT Wakeman and Elizabeth ?. He married (3)HANNAH (SPENCER)SEXTON November 29, 1698,widow
2 CONT of GEORGE SEXTON, dau. of THOMAS SPENCER, making the two Hannah's he married first cousins as
2 CONT Thomas Spencer was the brother of Hannah Spencer's father, GERARD SPENCER.
2 CONT DANIEL BRAINERD died April 1, 1715 at Haddam, CT.
