2 CONT Sarah BEARDING - b. about 1623; d. Sep. 11, 1685, Hartford, Hartford Co., CT. Daughter of Nathaniel BEARDING (d. Sep. 1674, Hartford, CT) and his first wife (name unknown). Nathaniel was in Hartford by 1636; townsman 1658; surveyo
2 CONC r of highways 1666. His name appears on Hartford's Founders Monument. He was fined 10 s. in 1649 for sleeping when on watch. He married second Abigail (d. Mar. 20, 1682/33), widow of William ANDREWS, and wrote his will Jan. 7, 167
2 CONC 4. His estate was inventoried at £282 Sep. 14, 1674. Two children of Abigail (<nowiki>----</nowiki>) ANDREWS BEARDING married children of Thomas SPENCER.
2 CONT
