2 CONT *Four brother named Spencer were living in New England in 1648, namely - Michael, Jared, '''Thomas''' and William. they were legatees of Sir Richard Spencer, of London, England, evidently their uncle. Michael settled first in Camb
2 CONC ridge, then in Lynn, and owned land also on the Connecticut river. William settled in Cambridge and then went to Hartford, Connecticut. '''Thomas lived in Cambridge and Hartford.''' ____________________
