2 CONT *In America many Spencers have been traced back genetically to four Spencer brothers: William Spencer 1601–1640, '''Thomas Spencer 1607–1687''', Michael Spencer 1611–1653, and Gerard Spencer 1614–1685.[55][56]
2 CONT *From: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spencer_(surname) ____________________
