1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Sexton-2856
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth was born in February 13 1716. She was the daughter of Charles Sexton and Sarah Jamison. She passed away in May 2 1807. [1] She married Jonas Adams/Addams June 24 1736 in Huntington New York.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT They were the parents of:
2 CONT
2 CONT John baptized with father Oct 9 1737
2 CONT Elizabeth baptized Mar 2 1739/1740
2 CONT Betsy 5 born about 1742 may be Elizabeth.
2 CONT Phebe baptized May 12 1742
2 CONT Sarah baptized Oct 7 1744
2 CONT Jonas b Mar 2 1753, d Jul 16 1837.[3][4][5]
2 CONT Research Note
2 CONT
2 CONT The alternate spelling Addams/Addoms was used by the descendants of Jonas Adams/Addoms, son of Jonas and Elizabeth Sexton Adams. This spelling is used in Family Search Records which may result in duplicate records as found on this
2 CONC  cite."Family Tree," database, FamilySearch (http://familysearch.org : modified 08 January 2019, 12:48), entry for Elizabeth Sexton(PID https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/4:1:LVV9-6BY); contributed by various users or unlinked fa
2 CONC milies in Findagrave Memorials such as this family.
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth (Sexton) Adams (1716 - 1807)
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Elizabeth Adams formerly Sexton===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 13 Feb 1716 in Huntington, Suffolk, Long Island, New York
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of Charles Sexton Sr and Sarah (Jamison) Sexton
2 CONT
2 CONT Sister of Hannah (Sexton) Platt, Esther Pricilla (Sexton) Rogers, Charles Sexton Jr, Keziah (Sexton) Brush, George Sexton, Sarah (Saxton) Hallock, Bathsheba (Sexton) Hill, Joseph William Sexton, Mabel (Sexton) Stout, Nathaniel Sex
2 CONC ton, Nehemiah Sexton [half], Taphath (Sexton) Titus [half] and Jared Sexton [half]
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of Jonas Adams — married [date unknown] [location unknown]
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother of John Addoms and Jonas Adams
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 2 May 1807 at age 91 in Plattsburgh, Clinton, New York, United States
2 CONT
2 CONT Profile last modified 24 Apr 2022 | Created 2 Apr 2018
2 CONT
