2 CONC Prior to 1700. Baltimore, MD, USA: Genealogical Publishing Co., 2004.</ref><ref>Clemens, William Montgomery. American Marriage Records Before 1699. Pompton Lakes, NJ, USA: Biblio Co., 1926.</ref>Joan died 22 May 1684 in Westfield,
