2 CONT ===Marriage===
2 CONT She married Increase Sikes on March 22, 1671 at Springfield, Massachusetts.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Children of the couple===#John born April 23, 1672 at Springfield, MA.  Died November 10, 1689 at Springfield.#Nathaniel born July 7, 1673 at Springfield, MA.  Married Elizabeth Ball.#Increase Jr. born January 1, 1674 at Spring
2 CONC field, MA.  Married (1) Mary Knowlton; Married (2) Mary Warriner.#Abigail born March 16, 1676 at Springfield, MA.  Married William Hendrick; married (2) unknown Smith.#Rebecca born September 15, 1678 at Springfield, MA.  Married S
2 CONC amuel Wright.
