2 CONT #James born March 14, 1682 at Springfield.  Died May 24, 1683.#James (2nd) born March 27, 1684 at Springfield MA.  d. at Springfield.#Benjamin born December 5, 1685 at Springfield, MA.  Died June 30, 1687 at Springfield.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Death===
2 CONT Abigail died June 19, 1733 at Springfield, Massachusetts.
