1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *'''GILBERT, Thomas 
2 CONT *'''b. 15 MAR 1658/9 
2 CONT *'''d. 14 MAY 1698 Springfield, Hampden, Mass.
2 CONT *'''Parents:
2 CONT *Father: GILBERT, Thomas 
2 CONT *Mother: CHAPIN, Catherine 
2 CONT *Family:
2 CONT *'''Marriage: 4 AUG 1680 Springfield, Hampden, Mass.
2 CONT *'''Spouse: MARSHFIELD, Abilene 
2 CONT *b. 2 APR 1664 Springfield, Hampden, Mass.
2 CONT *d. 26 NOV 1689 Brookfield, Worcester, Mass.
2 CONT *Parents:
2 CONT *Father: MARSHFIELD, Samuel 
2 CONT *Mother: WRIGHT, Hester 
2 CONT *'''Children:
2 CONT **GILBERT, Thomas 
2 CONT **GILBERT, Samuel  b. 4 SEP 1683 Springfield, Hampden, Mass.
2 CONT **GILBERT, Sarah  b. 11 SEP 1685 Springfield, Hampden, Mass.  d. 14 OCT 1685 Springfield, Hampden, Mass.
2 CONT **GILBERT, Jonathan 
2 CONT **GILBERT, John  b. 28 FEB 1686/7 Springfield, Hampden, Mass.  d. 1687 Springfield, Hampden, Mass.
2 CONT **GILBERT, Ebenezer  b. 1689 Springfield, Hampden, Mass.  d. 4 JAN 1690/1 Springfield, Hampden, Mass.
2 CONT *Family:
2 CONT *'''Marriage: 9 APR 1690 Springfield, Hampden, Mass.
2 CONT *'''Spouse:BANCROFT, Ann 
2 CONT *'''Children:
2 CONT **GILBERT, John 
2 CONT **GILBERT, Ebenezer  b. 4 JAN 1691/2 Springfield, Hampden, Mass.
