2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT [[Category: Gilbert Name Study, Y-DNA Haplogroup G-M201 GROUP 01, Braintree, MA -Yardley, UK Type 1 - A]]
2 CONT == Biography ==Thomas the son of Thomas Gilbert was born in Springfield, Massachusetts on 15 Mar 1658.≤ref>"Massachusetts, Springfield Vital Records, 1638-1887," database with images, FamilySearch (https://familysearch.org/ark:/61
2 CONC 903/1:1:XPJF-3JW : 9 February 2018), Thomas Gilbert, 15 Mar 1658;citing , Springfield, Hampden, Massachusetts, Springfield City Hall; FHL microfilm 185,414.Thomas Gilbert, the son of [[Gilbert-196|Thomas Gilbert]] and [[Chapin-15|
2 CONC Catherine Chapin]] was living in Springfield, Massachusetts by 1680, when he married [[Marshfield-35|Abilene Marshfield]].≤/ref>
2 CONT After the death of his first wife in 1689, Thomas remarried, in 1690, to [[Bancroft-86|Anna Bancroft]].
2 CONT Thomas moved to Brookfield, Massachusetts with his brother, Henry. "[[Gilbert-259|Capt. Henry Gilbert]] was sent to Ouobaug (Brookfield) to protect the settlers from the Indians, and built a fort there, afterwards settling there w
2 CONC ith his brother Thomas Gilbert {III}."≤ref>Randalland allied families, page 322≤/ref>
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas died in 1698.
2 CONT
2 CONT === Notes ===
2 CONT The Gilbert Family Descendants of Thomas Gilbert, 1582(?)-1659page 88 has son Ebenezer born after the death of the first wife.  I moved Ebenezer to second wife.  Other databases had him under second wife.
2 CONT Thomas Gilbert, III [137f] (Springfield, March 15, 1659/1660 – d. there May 14, 1698) married Aug. 4 1680, Abilene Marshfield [137fm] (April 2, 1664 – Nov. 26 1689) daughter of Samuel and Hester (Wright) Marshfield; married 2nd Ap
2 CONC ril 1690 Anna Bancroft [137fmm] daughter of Thomas and Margaret (Wright) Bancroft of Enfield, Conn., who married 2ndJames Sexton of Westfield; had by first wife: (Gen. 7) Thomas Gilbert, IV [137fa] (b. Nov. 3, 1681); Samuel Gilber
2 CONC t [137fb] (b. Sept. 4, 1683); Sarah Gilbert [137fc] (Sept. 11, 1685-Oct. 14, 1685); Jonathan Gilbert [137fd] (b. Nov. 4 1686) married Stratford, Aug. 5, 1707, Margery Searles [137fdm] had Stratford: (Gen. 6) Abilene Gilbert [137fd
2 CONC a] (b. Jan 11, 1708); Phebe Gilbert [137fdb] (b. Jan 1. 1709/10); and Katherine Gilbert [137fdc] (b. March 8 1712); (Gen 7. Cont) John Gilbert [137fe] (b. Feb. 28, 1687/8- d young); and Ebenezer Gilbert [137ff] (d. Jan 4, 1691/2);
2 CONC  by second wife: (Gen. 7 cont.) John Gilbert (b. March 16, 1691) married Stratford, Nov. 25 1714, Patience Lattin [137fgm]; Margaret Gilbert [137fh] (b. March 27, 1693); Sarah Gilbert [137fi] (b.Jan 18, 1694/5); and Anna Gilbert [
2 CONC 137fi] (b. Feb. 16, 1696/7) married Joseph Segar [137fjm]
2 CONT
