1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT == Biography ==[[Gilbert-5758|John Gilbert]] was born on 16 March 1690/91 to Thomas Gilbert III and his second wife, Anna (Bancroft) Gilbert -- later, AnnaSexton; John was the first child of this marriage, but the second sonof Tho
2 CONC mas to be given the name John.
2 CONT John married Patience Latting at Stratford, Connecticut, on 25 November 1714.  The couple lived in Ripton Parish, then part of Stratford, until removing to Hanover, New Jersey, at some point in the 1720s; they had six children.
2 CONT John Gilbert died at Hanover in the fall of 1756; his will was proved on 4 October of that year.
2 CONT
2 CONT == Sources ==
2 CONT ≤references />* Birth: Massachusetts: Vital Records, 1621-1850 (Online Database: AmericanAncestors.org, New England Historic Genealogical Society, 2001-2016); https://www.americanancestors.org/DB190/i/39814/42/65799040 (subscripti
2 CONC on required)
