2 CONC ecticut, 1953; p. 115; ebook available online (cost): https://www.ancestorstuff.com/E-Books/the-gilbert-family-descendants-of-thomas-gilbert-of-mt-wollaston-braintree-windsor-and-wethersfield-1582-1659.html
