1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Margaret Wright Bancroft=
2 CONT * BIRT 1633 England
2 CONT * DEATH 17 Dec 1699 (aged 65–66) Westfield, Hampden County, Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT * BURIAL Springfield Cemetery, Springfield, Hampden County, Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT * PLOT Willow Avenue 2-97
2 CONT * MEMORIAL ID 113298527 photo added by Angie Robinson   
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret Wright Born about 1633 in England to Deacon Samuel Wright Sr. and Margaret Stratton Wright.  She 1st married Thomas Bancroft, son of John Bancroft and Jane, on 8 Dec 1653 in (Springfield/Northampton), Hampden County, Mass
2 CONC achusetts. Margaret died before Thomas Bancroft and he remarried before 29 August 1670 when he had a daughter Ruth born by his second wife. [5]  He died in Enfield, CT 14 Dec. 1684. Margaret Wright died before 1670, probably in We
2 CONC stfield, Hampden County, Massachusetts. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Notes==
2 CONT Although some say she married Thomas Bliss, that was Margaret Hulins. [6]
2 CONT
