2 CONT Married 1) MARGARET WRIGHT14,15 December 08, 1653 in Springfield, MA, daughter of SAMUEL WRIGHT and MARGARET. She was born June 30, 1624 in Springfield, Hampden, MA, and died 1668 in Westfield, MA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married 2) HANNAH GARDNER16 November 22, 1676 in Hadley, Hampshire, MA, daughter of SAMUEL GARDNER and LYDIA OLDHAM. She was born Abt. 1642 in Springfield, Hampden, MA, and died December 11, 1711 in Enfield, Hartford, CT.
2 CONT
