1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The surname "MacKerany" is more frequently rendered as "MacCranney" or "McCranney" in available records.  William and Margaret (Riley) MacCranney were parents to at least seven children (in no particular birth orde
2 CONC r) -- 1.) William Riley McCranney, 2.) John McCranney, 3.) Thomas McCranney, 4.) Margaret McCranney, 5.) Mary McCranney, 6.) Abigail McCranney, and 7.) Sarah McCranney.  The latter married John Sackett III. 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT "WILLIAM McCRANNEY, who d. at Springfield, 25 Oct. 1725. Hem. (2) 20 Apr.
2 CONT 1702, Mary (Burbank) Miller, dau. of John and Susanna (Merrill) Burbank,
2 CONT and widow of Lazarus Miller [Miller Family, No. 2, i]. Shem. (3) 18 Jan. 173.3/4,
2 CONT James Sexton of Westfield. " and 
2 CONT "The land of Margaret McCranny "belongs to her nine children viz."
2 CONT Thomas McCranny, John McCranny, William McCranny, Margaret Cooley,
2 CONT Mary Bliss, Sarah Sackett, Mercy Ball, Thankful Burt, and Abigail McCranny"
2 CONT  - https://www.seekingmyroots.com/members/files/G003298.pdf page 727
