1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 5. SUSANNA7 MERRILL (NATHANIEL6 *MERRILL, NATHANIEL5, JOHN4 *MERRELL, THE YOUNGER, JOHN3 *MERYELL, JOHN2, THOMAS1) was born Bef. December 12, 1638 in Lawford, Essex, England, and died October 10, 1690 in Sufffield,
2 CONC  Hartford, Conn. She married JOHN BURBANK October 15, 1663 in Newbury, Essex, Mass, son of JOHN BURBANK and ANN JORDAN. He was born 1640 in Rowley, Mass, and died June 1, 1709.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for SUSANNA MERRILL: Addendum 1996:Baptismal records show thart Susan Merrill was baptized on 12 Dec 1638 in Lawford, Essex, Co., England.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of SUSANNA MERRILL and JOHN BURBANK are: i. MARY8 BURBANK, b. Bef. June 24, 1666, Rowley, Essex, Mass; d. October 16, 1740, Westfield, Mass. ii. TIMOTHY BURBANK, b. May 30, 1668, Haverhill, Essex, Mass; d. Unknown. iii. J
2 CONC OHN BURBANK, b. August 1670, Haverhill, Essex, Mass; d. March 25, 1729; m. MARY GRANGER, December 21, 1699, Suffield, Conn; b. 1661, Newbury, Essex, Mass; d. December 21, 1699, Suffield, Hartford, Conn. iv. EBENEZER BURBANK, b. Ma
2 CONC rch 4, 1673/74, Haverhill, Essex, Mass; d. Unknown; m. REBECCA TAYLOR PRITCHARD, October 9, 1699, Suffield, MA; b. Aft. 1674; d. Unknown.
