2 CONT ** He married Freedom on 18 Nov 1662. 
2 CONT ** See children with Freedom below. 
2 CONT * His second wife was '''Abigail Bartlet Stebbins''' 
2 CONT ** md. 28 Dec 1681. 
2 CONT ** He had one dau. named Mary with Abigail Stebbins. 
2 CONT * His third wife was '''Mary Hart Lee''' 
2 CONT ** Married on 05 Jan 1691.[2]
