2 CONT '''Jedediah''' - b. May 7, 1637, MA; d. May 22, 1733. 
2 CONT * '''Married first Nov. 18, 1662 Freedom WOODWARD''' 
2 CONT ** (d. May 17, 1681), daughter of Henry and Elizabeth. 
2 CONT * Jedediah '''married second Dec. 19, 1681 Abigail STEBBINS''' 
2 CONT ** (b. Sep. 6, 1660; d. Jul. 15, 1689), daughter of John STEBBINS and Abigail BARTLETT. 
2 CONT * Jedediah '''married third Mary HART''' 
2 CONT ** (d. 1710), daughter of Stephen HART and widow of John LEE. 
2 CONT * '''Children of Jedediah and Freedom:''' 
2 CONT ** Elizabeth married Ebenezer WRIGHT; 
2 CONT ** Abigail married Thomas KING; 
2 CONT ** Jedediah married Abias INGERSOL; 
2 CONT ** Ford died in infancy; 
2 CONT ** a child died in infancy; 
2 CONT ** Hannah married Benjamin CARPENTER; 
2 CONT ** Thankful married Thomas ROOT (grandparents of Hon. Jessie ROOT); 
2 CONT ** John died in infancy; Lydia married David LEE; 
2 CONT ** Mary died in infancy; 
2 CONT ** Experience died in infancy; 
2 CONT ** Preserved married Tabitha LEE (ancestors of Capt. Nathan HALE and Lady Diana SPENCER); and 
2 CONT ** John died young. 
2 CONT * '''Child of Jedediah and Abigail:''' 
2 CONT ** Mary married Ebenezer PIXLEY. "
