1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Abigail Bartlett was born say 1637. She was the daughter of Robert Bartlett and Anne unknown. On 17 December 1657 in Northampton, Hampshire County, Massachusetts, Abigail married first John Stebbins, son of Rowland
2 CONC  Stebbins and Sarah Whiting. On 28 December 1681 in Northampton, Hampshire County, Massachusetts, Abigail married second Jedediah Strong, son of Elder John Strong. Abigail Bartlett died on Friday, 15 July 1689 in Northampton, Hamp
2 CONC shire County, Massachusetts.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children of Abigail Bartlett and John Stebbins:'''
2 CONT * ◦Samuel Stebbins (21 Jan 1658/59 - 3 Sep 1732)
2 CONT * ◦Abigail Stebbins (24 Sep 1660 - 11 Oct 1710)
2 CONT * ◦Thomas Stebbins (6 May 1662 - )
2 CONT * ◦Hannah Stebbins (8 Jul 1664 - 29 Feb 1704)
2 CONT * ◦Mary Stebbins (10 Sep 1666 - )
2 CONT * ◦Sarah Stebbins (4 Jun 1668 - )
2 CONT * ◦Joseph Stebbins (17 Jan 1669/70 - 3 Jun 1681)
2 CONT * ◦Deborah Stebbins (5 Mar 1671 - )
2 CONT * ◦Benjamin Stebbins (3 May 1674 - )
2 CONT * ◦Rebecca Stebbins (20 Feb 1676 - )
2 CONT * ◦Thankful Stebbins (11 May 1678 - )
2 CONT
2 CONT CAME TO AMERICA 1631/32
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Abigail Bartlett Stebbins Strong was===
2 CONT
2 CONT * the '''daughter of''' Robert and Ann (Warringer) Bartlett, and the 
2 CONT * '''wife of''' 1) John Stebbins, and 2) Jedediah Strong.
2 CONT * John Stebbins married Abigail Bartlett on 17 Dec 1657 in Hartford, Hartford County, CT. 
2 CONT ** daughter of Robert BARTLETT and Ann WARRINGER 
2 CONT
2 CONT * Abigail was born on 26 Sep 1636 in Hartford, Hartford County, CT. She died falling from her horse on 10 Oct 1710 in South Hadley Falls, Hamshire County, Massachusetts, USA.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''They had the following children:'''
