2 CONT in King Philips War.  His name is on ther monument to prominent foundersin
2 CONT Hartford.  Abigale and John were married 17 Dec 1657 and had 10 children.
2 CONT
2 CONT After John's death, Abigale married Jedediah Strong, son of Elder JohnStrong
2 CONT on 28 Dec 1681.
2 CONT [thomas stebbins.FTW]
2 CONT
2 CONT Father Robert Bartlett, Mother Anna Mary War5iner.  Possibly born inEngland
2 CONT rather than Hartford.  After John's death married 28 Dec 1681 JebediahStrong,
2 CONT son of Elder John Strong.
