2 CONT The following info was acquired from <http://members.tripod.com/mviens/stebbins.htm> (copy filed L-4-24):
2 CONT
2 CONT SECOND MARRIAGE OF JOHN STEBBINS I
2 CONT
2 CONT John STEBBINS I remarried in Northampton on December 17, 1657 to Abigail BARTLETT, born probably in Hartford, CT, the daughter of Robert and Anne BARTLETT.  John and Abigail had 11 children, all born in Northampton, and making Joh
2 CONC n STEBBINS I the father of 16 children:
2 CONT
2 CONT F) Samuel STEBBINS, born at Northampton on January 21, 1659.  On March 14, 1678, he married Mary FRENCH, daughter of John FRENCH and ? Kingsley.  He deserted her, and on March 12, 1692 married Sarah WILLIAMS, in Rhode Island.  On 
2 CONC December 27, 1692 Mary FRENCH obtained a divorce on the grounds that her husband had had children by Sarah WILLIAMS.
2 CONT
2 CONT G) Abigail STEBBINS, born September 6, 1660, at Northampton.  Married William PHELPS there on May 30, 1678.
2 CONT
2 CONT H) Thomas STEBBINS, born in Northampton, on May 6, 1662.  On September 26, 1684 he married Elizabeth WRIGHT, daughter of Samuel WRIGHT and Elizabeth BURT.
2 CONT
2 CONT I) Hannah STEBBINS, born July 8, 1664, in Northampton.  She married John SHELTON, son of Isaac SHELTON and Mary WOODFORD on November 15, 1679.  She died on February 29, 1704, in the Deerfield massacre.  Stout resistance had been m
2 CONC ade at the house of Captain SHELTON, and Indians shot her through a hole chopped in the door of her house.  The door is now on display in the small museum in Deerfield.
2 CONT
2 CONT J) Mary STEBBINS, born in Northampton on September 10, 1666.  Married Thomas STRONG there on November 17, 1683.
2 CONT
2 CONT K) Sarah STEBBINS, born in Northampton on June 4 1668.  Married there to William SOUTHWELL in 1687.
2 CONT
2 CONT L) Joseph STEBBINS, born in Northampton, on January 17, 1670.  Buried there on June 3, 1681.
2 CONT
2 CONT M) Deborah STEBBINS, born in Northampton, March 5, 1672.  Married first to Benjamin ALVORD.  Remarried to Benjamin BURT.
2 CONT
2 CONT N) Benjamin STEBBINS, baptized May 3, 1674, in Northampton.  Married Mary ASHLEY, daughter David ASHLEY and Hannah GLOVER, on December 21, 1709.
2 CONT
2 CONT O) Rebecca STEBBINS, baptized February 26, 1676 in Northampton.  In 1697 she married Nathaniel STRONG.
2 CONT
2 CONT P) Thankful STEBBINS, born May 11, 1678, in Northampton.  Married Jeriah STRONG on July 18, 1700.
2 CONT
2 CONT After the death of John STEBBINS I on March 9, 1679, his widow, Abigail, remarried on December 28, 1681, to Jedediah STRONG, son of the Elder John STRONG.  She died on July 15, 1689.
2 CONT ----------------------------------------------
