2 CONT
2 CONT Descendants Of Robert Bartlett
2 CONT Submitted By: Ruth Bartlett TILADY@aol.com
2 CONT This is in reference to Robert Bartlett possible merges.
2 CONT -----------------------------------
2 CONT I was searching the web when I came across your web site and I have to say, that the information I have provided for you below has been proven with birth, marriage and death records along with tombstone names dates and places... I
2 CONC  hope I have answered some of your questions.. Please would you be so kind as to change the information on your web page to reflect what I have sent you... If you have any more questions, Please Please feel free to contact me... T
2 CONC hank you - Ruth Bartlett.
