2 CONT * [https://books.google.com/books?id=X6VPAAAAMAAJ&vq=Nancy%20durand&pg=PA324#v=onepage&q&f=false page 324] of Root Genealogical Records. 1600-1870: Comprising the General History of the ... By James Pierce Root.  Amos # 2889 son o
2 CONC f Joseph # 2824
2 CONT
2 CONT -----------------
2 CONT
2 CONT https://books.google.com/books?id=X6VPAAAAMAAJ&vq=Nancy%20durand&pg=PA324#v=onepage&q&f=false
2 CONT
2 CONT Amos Root, son of Joseph (2824), grandson of Thomas (2895), b. — 3, 1733, at Westfield, Mass. ;
2 CONT
2 CONT  m. (1) March 17, 1756, Abigail, dau. of Benj. and Abigail Sheldon. She d. Oct. 17, 1758. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He m. (2) Azubah Hubbard;
2 CONT
2 CONT  m. (3) . 
2 CONT
2 CONT His father, Ensign Joseph Root, made a codicil to his will, leaving ,£200 more to his son Amos, "provided he does not learn a trade." Probably he wished him to remain on a farm.* He rem. with his brother Eli to Pittsfield, Mass., 
2 CONC where he remained as late as 1 771, and from thence he rem. to a place then called Benson (now Pittsford), Vt.
2 CONT
2 CONT  Children: (By first marriage.) (Born in Pittsfield, Mass.) 3095.
2 CONT
2 CONT  I. Amos, b. July 18, 1757, f. ; d. 1813, as. 56. 3096.
2 CONT
2 CONT  II. Abigail, b. Oft 17, 1758 : d. young. 
2 CONT
2 CONT (By second marriage.) 3097.
2 CONT
2 CONT  III. Lucy, b. May 16, 176;, f 3098.
2 CONT
2 CONT  IV. Rhoda, b. Oft. 17, 1766, f. ; d. a. 1859, x. a. 93. 3099.
2 CONT
2 CONT  V. Justin, b. Jan. 11, 1768, f. 3100. 
2 CONT
2 CONT VI. Naomi, b. Aug. 11, 1769; m. John Turner. 3101. 
2 CONT
2 CONT VII. Azubah, b. March 7, 1771 ; m. Elias Baker. 
2 CONT
2 CONT (Probably born in Vermont.) 3102. 
2 CONT
2 CONT VIII. Irene. 3103.
2 CONT
2 CONT  IX. Silas, b. 1774, f. ; d. 1867, x. 93. 3104. 
2 CONT
2 CONT X. Elijah, b. Aug. 29, 1775, f. ; d. Feb. 19, 1809, x. 33. 3105. 
2 CONT
2 CONT XI. Desire, f. 3'°7- 
2 CONT
