2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary, was the dau. of Henry and Elizabeth (Warriner) Burt, of Springfield, MA. Mary, married Noah Hitchcock, on 28 Nov 1738 in Springfield. Mary and Noah removed to Brimfield, MA, and had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Noah Hitchcock Jr. (1739-1826) Elijah Hitchcock (1741-1813) Mary Hitchcock (1743-1820) 
