2 CONT Samuel married Hannah Morgan 17 May 1682 and had four children; Hannah, Samuel, Rebecca and Ebenezer. Hannah died 17 Jan 1697.
2 CONT
2 CONT Secondly, Samuel married Martha Boardman, the daughter of Samuel and widow of Benjamin Crane Jr. They were married 04 Jan 1698 and had st least two children: Benjamin Terry (who married Hannah Pease and fathered Submit Terry and J
2 CONC acob Terry)]
