1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Twin of Samuel
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: 	Jan. 25, 1630 Berry Pomeroy Devon, England Death: 	Aug. 15, 1718 Springfield Hampden County Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry was a sea captain, also served 7 years in the Royal Navy. He died in Springfield, but had his body shipped back to Paignton, Devonshire for burial-- odd at first glance because his parents were bur in the New World. However 
2 CONC the note I have on his gf is "Paignton, Devonshire, buried at sea"-- so perhaps the Royal Naval connection took precedence for him. 
2 CONT
