2 CONT   Josiah Chapin (1634 - 1726)**
2 CONT   Japhet Chapin (1642 - 1712)**
2 CONT   Hannah Chapin Hitchcock (1644 - 1711)*
2 CONT
2 CONT *Calculated relationship
2 CONT **Half-sibling
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial: Body buried at sea Specifically: Henry served in the Royal Navy, as did his grandfather. Paignton is right on the coast, which also makes sense.
