2 CONT Brief Life History of Henry
2 CONT
2 CONT When Captain Henry Chapin was born on 25 January 1631, in Berry Pomeroy, Devon, England, his father, Deacon Samuel Chapin, was 33 and his mother, Cicely Penny, was 29. He married Bethiah Cooley on 15 December 1664, in Springfield,
2 CONC  Hampshire, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 4 daughters. He died on 15 August 1718, in Springfield, Hampshire, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, at
2 CONC  the age of 87, and was buried in Springfield Cemetery, Springfield, Hampshire, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America.
