2 CONT Brief Life History of Bethiah
2 CONT
2 CONT Bethiah Cooley was born on 16 September 1643, in Springfield, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America as the daughter of Benjamin Cooley and Sarah. She married Captain Henry Chapin on 15 December 1664, in Springfield, H
2 CONC ampshire, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 4 daughters. She lived in Hatfield, Hampshire, Massachusetts, United States in 1643. She died on 9 December 1711, in Spring
2 CONC field, Hampden, Massachusetts, United States, at the age of 68, and was buried in Springfield, Hampden, Massachusetts, United States.
