2 CONT Son of Samuel Chapin and Cicely (Penny) Chapin
2 CONT Brother of Sarah (Chapin) Thomas, David Chapin, Katherine (Chapin) Marshfield, Henry Chapin, Samuel Chapin, John Chapin, Honor Chapin, Josiah Chapin and Hannah (Chapin) Hitchcock
2 CONT Husband of Abilenah (Cooley) Chapin — married 22 Jul 1664 in Springfield, Hampden, Massachusettsmap
2 CONT Husband of Dorothy (Root) Miller — married 31 May 1711 in Springfield, Hampshire, Province of Massachusetts Baymap
