2 CONT '''JAPHAT CHAPIN''' .......  Birth:  Aug. 15, 1642 Springfield Hampden County Massachusetts, USA  Death:  Feb. 20, 1712 Springfield Hampden County Massachusetts, USA 
2 CONT
2 CONT Japhat is the son of Samuel Deacon Chapin and Cicely Penny.He married (1) Abilenah COOLEY 22 Jul 1664, daughter of Samuel COOLEY. He married (2) Dorothy ROOT 31 May 1711, of Enfield, Connecticut. Japhet Chapin probably for time re
2 CONC sided in Milford, Connecticut. John Pynchon deeded land in Springfield to him in 1669. He was engaged in the battle with the Indians at Turners Falls in 1676 and was a deacon in the church in Springfield. Japhet was baptised 15 Oc
2 CONC t 1642.(Source: The Chapin Book of Genealogical Data Of the Descendants of Deacon Samuel Chapin by Gilbert Warren Chapin; pg. 3) Children of Japhet CHAPIN and Abilenah COOLEY are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i.Samuel CHAPIN, b. 4 Jul 1665; d. 19 Oct 1729. ii.Sarah CHAPIN, b. 15 Mar 1668; d. 23 Nov 1747. iii.Thomas CHAPIN, b. 20 May 1671; d. 27 Aug 1755. iv.John CHAPIN, b. 14 May 1674; d. 1 Jun 1759. v.Ebenezer CHAPIN, b. 26 Jun 1676;d
2 CONC . 13 Dec 1772 vi.Hannah CHAPIN, b. 21 Jun 1679; d. 7 Jul 1679. vii.Hannah CHAPIN, b. 18 Jul 1680; d. 30 Sep 1765. viii.David CHAPIN, b. 16 Nov 1682; d. 17 Jul 1772.
2 CONT  (bio by: Barbara Chapin) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Family links: 
2 CONT  Parents:
2 CONT   Samuel Chapin (1588 - 1675)
2 CONT   Cecily Penny Chapin (1601 - 1683)
2 CONT
2 CONT  Spouse:
2 CONT   Abilene Cooley Chapin (1643 - 1711)*
2 CONT
2 CONT  Children:
2 CONT   Thomas Chapin (1671 - 1755)*
2 CONT   John Chapin (1674 - 1759)*
2 CONT   Ebenezer Chapin (1677 - 1772)*
2 CONT   David Chapin (1682 - 1772)*
2 CONT   Jonathan Chapin (1688 - 1761)*
2 CONT
2 CONT *Calculated relationship
2 CONT
2 CONT Inscription: Mr.  Japhat  Chapin dy'd (sic)  on Febr ye 20  1712 aged 70  year
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: Grave moved from Old Elm Street / Old Court Square Burial Ground in 1848. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial: Springfield Cemetery  Springfield Hampden County Massachusetts, USA Plot: Willow Avenue 1-10 
2 CONT
