2 CONT Japhet CHAPIN and '''Abelenah Or Abilene COOLEY''' were married on 22 Jul 1664 in Milford, New Haven, Connecticut Children were: Daniel CHAPIN, Samuel CHAPIN, Sarah CHAPIN, Thomas CHAPIN, John CHAPIN, Ebenezer CHAPIN, Hannah CHAPI
