2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT John Chapin was born May 14, 1674 at Springfield, Massachusetts Bay, the son of Japhet Chapin and his wife Abilena (Cooley) Chapin.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Sarah Bridgeman on February 12, 1701/2, the daughter of John & Mary (Sheldon) Bridgeman of Northampton, Mass.[1]
