2 CONT Jonathan Chapin
2 CONT * Born 23 Sep 1688 in Springfield, Hampden, Massachusetts Bay
2 CONT * Son of Japhet Chapin and Abilenah (Cooley) Chapin
2 CONT * Brother of Samuel Chapin I, Sarah (Chapin) Munn, Thomas Chapin, John Chapin, Ebenezer Chapin, Hannah Chapin, Hannah (Chapin) Childs, David Chapin and Japhet Chapin [half]	
2 CONT * Husband of Elizabeth (Burt) Chapin — married [date unknown] [location unknown]
2 CONT * Father of Jonathan Chapin Jr., Eunice (Chapin) Dorchester, Zeruiah (Chapin) Pease, Rebekah (Chapin) Sexton and Timothy Chapin
2 CONT * Died 23 Feb 1761 at age 72 in Springfield, Hampden, Massachusetts Bay
2 CONT
2 CONT M Elizabeth Burt, dau of Jonathan Burt II and Lydia Dumbleton Cooley
2 CONT
2 CONT Jonathan Chapin was born September 23, 1688 [2] at Springfield. [3] [2] [4] He had a brother named Jonathan Chapin who was born February 20, 1685 [5] and died March 1,1685/6. [6]
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Elizabeth Burt, [7] [3] according to "The Chapin Book of Genealogical Data", [2] daughter of Jonathan and Lydia (Dumbleton) Burt of Longmeadow. Elizabeth was born February 23, 1689. [2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Children [2]''' (since the marriage to Elizabeth Burt is now unsure, makes these children suspect. more research is needed on marriage and children)'''
2 CONT
2 CONT *     Jonathan Chapin was born July 8, 1711,[3] and died November 12, 1763. 
2 CONT *     Elizabeth was born July 13, 1714.[3] She was still living on November 30, 1756 when her father's will was made.[2]She married Mr. Burt of Longmeadow.[8] 
2 CONT *     Daniel was born March 5, 1717.[3] He was supposedly taken prisoner by Spaniards. 
2 CONT *     Eunice Chapin was born February 11, 1719 and died November 1, 1780[2] in North Bolton, CT. She married David Dorchester.[8] 
2 CONT *     Ezekiel was born March 10, 1721,[3] and died April 1, 1721.[3] 
2 CONT *     Zerviah (Zeruiah) was born April 27, 1722,Zeruiah Chapin and died January 5, 1812.[2]She married Samuel Pease III of Enfield, CT.[8] 
2 CONT *     Gideon was born August 4, 1726,[3] and died August 13, 1726.[3] 
2 CONT *     Rebekah Chapin was born February 25, 1728,[3] and died May 22, 1759.[2]She married Joseph Sexton of Somers, CT.[8] 
2 CONT *     Ezra was born January 12, 1730,[3] and died October 12, 1747.[3] 
2 CONT *     Timothy Chapin was born March 8, 1733,[3] and died December 30, 1761. 
2 CONT *     Lydia was born October 20, 1734.[3][2]She married Isaac Brancraft of Windsor, CT on June 20, 1765.[8]  
2 CONT
2 CONT Jonathan died February 23, 1761, [3] and Elizabeth his wife died January 31, 1769. (since marriage to Elizabeth Burt is unsure, this death date needs to be verified.)[2] [9] 
