1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~hwbradley/aqwg2312.htm#45353
2 CONT
2 CONT Patience BURT [daughter of Henry Burt and Eulalia March] ] 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 was born 18 Aug 1645 in Springfield, Hampden, Massachusetts. She died 25 Oct 1732 in Springfield, Hampden, Massachusetts. Patience married 6 John BLISS on 7 
2 CONC Oct 1667 in Springfield, Hampden, Massachusetts.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT *  		M	i	John BLISS 1 was born 7 Sep 1669 in Springfield, Hampden, Massachusetts.
2 CONT *  		M	ii	Nathaniel BLISS was born 26 Jan 1671.
2 CONT *  		M	iii	Thomas BLISS 1 was born 29 Oct 1673 in Springfield, Hampden, Massachusetts.
2 CONT *  		M	iv	Joseph BLISS 1 was born 1676 in Springfield, Hampden, Massachusetts.
2 CONT *  		F	v	Hannah BLISS was born 16 Nov 1678 and died 26 Jul 1708.
2 CONT *  		M	vi	Henry BLISS 1 was born 15 Aug 1681 in Springfield, Hampden, Massachusetts. He died 30 Nov 1684 in Springfield, Hampden, Massachusetts.
2 CONT *  		M	vii	Ebenezer BLISS 1 was born 1683 in Springfield, Hampden, Massachusetts.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Patience (Burt) Bliss,  a 2nd Generation American, is Floyd Bliss Hanson's 7th Great Grandmother.
2 CONT
2 CONT Through her Sister Abigail (Burt) Ball, and her Parents Henry and Ulalia (Marche) Burt, the descendents of John and Patience (Burt) Bliss are related to Sir Winston Churchill.   Abigail (Burt) Ball is the 6th Great Grandmother of 
2 CONC Sir Winston Churchill, while Henry and Ulalia (Marche) Burt are 7th Great Grandparents of  Sir Winston Churchill.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT [[Category: Springfield Cemetery, Springfield, Massachusetts]]
2 CONT == Biography ==Patience Burt was born bef 18 Aug 1645 in Springfield, Hampden County,Massachussets.  She was a daughter of [[Burt-2|Henry Burt]] and [[Marche-1|Eulalia Marche]]. Patience Burt married John Bliss, son of [[Bliss-1 |
2 CONC  Thomas Bliss]] of Hartford on 7 Oct 1667 in Springfield, Hampden, Massachusetts.<ref>https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:3QS7-L9XW-XLYM?i=79 (https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:3QS7-L9XW-XLYM?i=79) image 80/164.<
2 CONC /ref> She passed away on 25 Oct 1732 in Springfield, Hampden County, Massachusetts.
2 CONT Patience was buried at [[:Category: Springfield Cemetery, Springfield,Massachusetts| Springfield Cemetery]], Springfield, Massachusetts.  Her [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=113313011 memorial] has links to 
2 CONC those of family members.<ref>[http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=113313011 Find A Grave Memorial # 113313011 Patience (Burt) Bliss].</ref>
2 CONT
2 CONT === Christening ===
2 CONT : Christening:   :: Date:  18 AUG 1645 :: Place:  Springfield, Hampden County, Massachusetts
2 CONT
