2 CONT  Spouse:
2 CONT   Jonathan Webster (1732 - 1797)*
2 CONT
2 CONT  Children:
2 CONT   Jonathan Webster (1764 - 1817)*
2 CONT
2 CONT *Calculated relationship
2 CONT
2 CONT Inscription: 19y
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial: First Presbyterian Churchyard  Elizabeth Union County New Jersey, USA
2 CONT
