1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Not the same as https://www.geni.com/people/Robert-Pease/6000000070019492903
2 CONT -------
2 CONT ===Robert Pease, Jr.===
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Robert Pease & Sara (Unknown), 25 Mar 1669, Salem, Massachusetts
2 CONT
2 CONT * Called Robert "The Latter"<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married Hannah Warriner on 24 Dec 1691, Enfield, Connecticut<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Notes==
2 CONT
2 CONT Served in King Phillips War from Salem.
2 CONT
2 CONT Born in Salem, he moved to Enfield where he received a grant of land on 30 Nov 1687.
2 CONT
2 CONT From a history of the Montague family comes the information that the Enfield Committee allotted him a portion of land on November 3, 1687, after he had been admitted as an "inhabitant" by the town. It is believed that he is the el
2 CONC dest son of Robert Pease of Salem, the weaver, and a nephew of John Pease, Sr.
2 CONT
2 CONT As he was not mentioned in the documents of the day, it is likely that Robert had moved prior to the 1692 witch hunt. In fact, his marriage in Hadley (or even if it was Enfield) shows he was gone from Salem.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Family==
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Hannah WARRINER on 24 Dec 1691 in Enfield, Hartford Co., CT.2 Hannah was born on 10 Sep 1674 in Hadley Or Northfield, MA and died in Enfield, Hartford Co., C
2 CONT
2 CONT 11 children 
2 CONT # Hannah  was born on 25 Mar 1692 in Enfield, Hartford Co., CT.2 
2 CONT # Mary was born on 19 Dec 1695 in Enfield, Hartford Co., CT.2 
2 CONT # Sarah was born on 25 May 1698 in Enfield, Hartford Co., CT.2 
2 CONT # Nathaniel  was born on 3 Oct 1700 in Enfield, Hartford Co., CT 2 and died in Stephentown, NY.2 
2 CONT # Experience was born on 4 Aug 1701 in Enfield, Hartford Co., CT.2 
2 CONT # Abigail was born on 27 Mar 1705 in Enfield, Hartford Co., CT.2 
2 CONT # Joseph  was born on 3 Aug 1707 in Enfield, Hartford Co., CT.2 
2 CONT # Bethia was born on 21 Nov 1709 in Enfield, Hartford Co., CT.2 
2 CONT # Miriam was born in Oct 1711 in Enfield, Hartford Co., CT.2 
2 CONT # Jemima was born in Oct 1712 in Enfield, Hartford Co., CT.2 
2 CONT # Benjamin was born on 1 Oct 1718 in Enfield, Hartford Co., CT 2 and died on 17 Jan 1781 in Enfield, Hartford Co., CT 2 at age 62. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Refs
2 CONT * Genealogy of the Geer family in America from 1635 to 1914 , p. 160.
2 CONT * three Mary Peases of Salem, Massachusetts by Ian Watson (The American Genealogist 70 1995: 205-208)
2 CONT * A genealogical and historical record of the descendants of John Pease, Sen, p. 6
