2 CONT ===Sarah Vore===
2 CONT * Birth:	Oct 6 1635 - Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut
2 CONT * Death:	Jan 1 1676 - Springfield, Hampden, Massachusetts
2 CONT * Parents:	Richard Vore, Ann Vore
2 CONT * Husband:	Benjamin Parsons
