2 CONT ===Ebenezer Parsons===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 17 Nov 1668 in Springfield, Hampden, Massachusetts
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Benjamin Parsons Sr and Sarah (Vore) Parsons
2 CONT
2 CONT Brother of Sarah (Parsons) Dorchester [half], Benjamin Parsons Jr, Abigail (Parsons) Richards [half], Samuel Parsons [half], Mary (Parsons) Richards [half] and Joseph Parsons [half]
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Margaret (Marshfield) Parsons — married 10 Apr 1690 in Hampden, Hampden, Massachusetts
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Ebenezer Parsons Jr., Margaret (Parsons) Elmer, Benjamin Parsons, Sarah (Parsons) Hitchcock and Jonathan Parsons
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 23 Sep 1752 at age 83 in Springfield, Hampden, Massachusetts
