2 CONT Birth: 	Sep. 27, 1642 New Haven New Haven County Connecticut, USA Death: 	Feb. 9, 1712 Springfield Hampden County Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Hannah Chapin Hitchcock, and son of Luke Hitchcock and Elizabeth Gibbons Hitchcock.
2 CONT
2 CONT Brother of Hannah Hitchcock Smith.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children: an infant daughter(dy), Hannah Hitchcock Parsons, John Hitchcock Jr, Samuel Hitchcock, Luke Hitchcock, Nathaniel Hitchcock, David Hitchcock, Jonathan Hitchcock, and Sarah Hitchcock.
