2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Chapin formerly Burt
2 CONT * Born 23 Feb 1689 in Longmeadow, Hampden, Massachusetts 
2 CONT * Daughter of Jonathan Burt II and Lydia (Dumbleton) Cooley 
2 CONT * Sister of Mercy (Burt) Kilborn, Lydia (Burt) Ely, David Burt and Sarah (Burt) Colton	 
2 CONT * Wife of Jonathan Chapin — married [date unknown] [location unknown] 
2 CONT * Mother of Jonathan Chapin Jr., Eunice (Chapin) Dorchester, Zeruiah (Chapin) Pease, Rebekah (Chapin) Sexton and Timothy Chapin 
2 CONT * Died 31 Jan 1769 at age 79 in Springfield, Hampden, Massachusettsmap 
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth, daughter of Jonathan Burt and Lydia Dumbleton, was born on 23 Feb 1688/89 at Longmeadow, Hampden County, MA,[1] and died on 31 Jan 1769 at Springfield, Hampshire County, MA.[1][2]
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Jonathan CHAPIN, son of Japhet CHAPIN and Abilene/Abilenah COOLEY, on 20 Apr 1710 at Springfield, Hampshire County, MA.2,1[3] They had 11 children (surname CHAPIN):
2 CONT
2 CONT *     Jonathan[1][2][4] 
2 CONT *     Elizabeth[5] 
2 CONT *     Daniel[1][2] 
2 CONT *     Eunice[1][2] 
2 CONT *     Eekiel[6] 
2 CONT *     Zerviah[1] 
2 CONT *     Gideon[7] 
2 CONT *     Rebecca[1][2] 
2 CONT *     Ezra[8] 
2 CONT *     Timothy[1][9] 
2 CONT *     Lydia[1][2][10]   
