1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Seth21, son of Seth11 and Elizabeth (Belding) Hawks, was born in 1757. He moved from the Turnip Yard section of Deerfield to Geneva, NY, in 1817, and died in Sodus, NY, in 1821. His widow, Tirzah (Taylor) Hawks, di
