1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Reference: [https://www.ancestry.com/family-tree/person/tree/109479322/person/122243851214/facts Ancestry Genealogy] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Feb 27 2021, 0:27:04 UTC''<br/>
