2 CONT
2 CONT When Noah Phelps Geer was born on May 28, 1791, in Charlestown, New Hampshire, his father, Thomas, was 44 and his mother, Mary, was 41. He married Sally Buchman on February 8, 1814, in his hometown. They had six children in 14 yea
2 CONC rs. He died on May 22, 1877, having lived a long life of 85 years.<br/>
2 CONT <br/><br/>
2 CONT The Geer Genealogy, A Historical Record of George and Thomas Geer and Their Descendants in the United States from 1623 to 1923 – Walter Geer [https://play.google.com/books/reader?id=w1lMAAAAMAAJ&pg=GBS.PA319]<br/>
