2 CONT *F, 
2 CONT *b. 23 August 1746
2 CONT
2 CONT Dorcas Smith was born on 23 August 1746 at Sandisfield. She was the daughter of Benjamin Smith and Ruth Snow. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Dorcas Smith married John Bull on 12 January 1770 at Sandsfield, Berkshire, MA.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
