2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of Jonathan Bush — married 17 Feb 1708 in Enfield, Massachusetts Bay
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of John Meacham — married 19 Apr 1758 in Enfield, Hartford, Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother of Jonathan Bush, Moses Bush, Aaron Bush, Miriam (Bush) Hale, Caleb Bush and Elizabeth (Bush) Hale
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 13 Jan 1786 in Enfield, Hartford, Connecticut, United States
