2 CONT Mary (Hempstead) Douglas (1647 - 1711) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Douglas formerly Hempstead
2 CONT Born:   26 Mar 1647 in New London, New London, Connecticut Ancestors: Daughter of Robert Hempstead and Joanna (Willey) Lester  Sister of Joshua Hempstead Sr. and Hannah (Hempstead) Moore  Wife of Robert Douglas — married 28 Sep 16
2 CONC 65 in New London, New London, Connecticut  Descendants:  Mother of William Douglas, Mary (Douglass) Chappell, Ann (Douglas) Waterhouse, John Douglass, Hannah Douglass, Sarah (Douglass) Comstock, Elizabeth (Douglas) Rowland, Thomas
2 CONC  Douglass, Phebe (Douglas) Jones, Phebe (Douglass) Baker, Susannah Douglas and Ruth Douglass  Died:   26 Dec 1711 in Newark, Essex, New Jersey  Profile managers: Richard Ludwig  [send private message], Ryan Myers  [send private me
2 CONC ssage], Shaun Powell  [send private message], and Chuck Plumb  [send private message]  Profile last modified 18 Mar 2020 | Created 3 Apr 2012 This page has been accessed 861 times.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary (Hempstead) Douglas is a member of Clan Douglas. Join: Scottish Clans Project Discuss: scottish_clans Biography  Mary, daughter of Robert and Joane Hempstead, was the first European child born in the new colony of Pequot, lat
2 CONC er New London, Connecticut[1]  Mary married Robert Douglass[2] in New London, New London, Connecticut.  She died 26 DEC 1711 in Newark, Essex, New Jersey, at age 64[3].  Sources  ↑ Source: #S1114149807 Book Title: Hyde Genealogy, 
2 CONC or, The Descendants, in the Female as Well as in the Male Lines, From William Hyde, of Norwich With Their Places of Residence and Dates of Births, Marriages, &c, and Other Particulars of Them and Their Families and Ancestry vol ↑ 
2 CONC Source: #S1114149816 Genealogical Publishing Co.; Baltimore, MD, USA; Volume Title: New England Marriages Prior to 1700 ↑ Source: #S1114149811  Hempstead, Joshua. Diary of Joshua Hempstead of New London, Connecticut (New London Co
2 CONC unty Historical Society, 1901) Page 607: "......his mother was a Daughter of my own Aunt Mary {Hempstead} ye wife of Robert Douglass. She {Mary} was my fathers Eldest Sister & Born in New London Jan. 1646**. the first Child of Eng
2 CONC lish Parents yt (that) was Born in this Town."  Ancestral File(R) (The Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints Publication: Copyright (c) 1987, June 1998, data as of 5 January 1998)  Source: S1114149746 Ancestry Family Trees P
2 CONC ublication: Online publication - Provo, UT, USA: Ancestry.com. Original data: Family Tree files submitted by Ancestry members. Ancestry Family Tree http://trees.ancestry.com/pt/AMTCitationRedir.aspx?tid=112726163&pid=142  Source: 
