1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Ruth Douglas''' was born abt 1685 in New London, New London Co., CT and died 30 Apr 1737 in Norwich, New London Co., CT [1, 2] 
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents: Robert Douglas (b. 1639, Scotland, d. 15 Jan 1714/15) and Mary Hempstead (b. 26 Mar 1647, New London, New London Co., CT)
2 CONT
2 CONT Married: 	
2 CONT # on 5 Dec 1711 in Norwich, New London Co., CT [2, 3] to Isaac Woodworth.  He was born Abt 1689, Scituate, Plymouth Co., MA and d. 4 Dec 1758, Lyme, New London Co., CT.  He was the son of Isaac Woodworth (b. abt. 1660 Scituate -d.
2 CONC  1714 Norwich, New London, CT) and Lydia Standlick.
2 CONT
2 CONT 9 children of Ruth Douglas and Isaac Woodworth:
2 CONT # Isaac Woodworth,  b. 26 Dec 1712, Norwich, New London Co., CT d. 3 Oct 1714   (died young)
2 CONT # Isaac Woodworth,  b. 30 Oct 1714, Norwich, New London Co., CT
2 CONT # Asa Woodworth,  b. 13 Feb 1716/17, Norwich, New London Co., CT
2 CONT # Ruth Woodworth,  b. 22 Sep 1718, Norwich, New London Co., CT 
2 CONT # John Woodworth,  b. 4 May 1722, Norwich, New London Co., CT
2 CONT # Grace Woodworth,  b. Abt 1724
2 CONT # Thomas Woodworth,  b. 17 Jul 1726, Norwich, New London Co., CT
2 CONT # Zerviah Woodworth,  b. 23 Sep 1728, Norwich, New London Co., CT
2 CONT # Nathan Woodworth,  b. 16 Sep 1732, Norwich, New London Co., CT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
