1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Elizabeth Post (John Post4, Stephen Post3, Abraham Post2, Thomas Post1) was born 22 FEB 1654/55 in Saybrook, CT, and died 1715. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family 
2 CONT
2 CONT From https://wc.rootsweb.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=michelotti&id=I341584
2 CONT
2 CONT She married 
2 CONT #John Sperry 1 SEP 1676 in New Haven, CT, son of Richard Sperry and Dennis. He was born 9 JAN 1648/49 in New Haven, CT, and died 1692 in New Haven, CT.
2 CONT #Benjamin Bunnell AFT MAR 1690/91, son of William Bunnell and Ann Wilmot. He died ABT 1696. 
2 CONT #Edmund Dorman 19 SEP 1700 in New Haven, CT. He was born ABT 1636, and died 1 MAY 1711 in New Haven, CT.
2 CONT  	  Children of Elizabeth Post and John Sperry are:
2 CONT *  i.	Esther Sperry.
2 CONT *  ii.	Mary Sperry was born 16 JAN 1678/79 in New Haven, CT, and died 16 MAR 1727/28.
2 CONT *  iii.	Richard Sperry was born 19 DEC 1681 in New Haven, CT, and died 1740.
2 CONT *  iv.	Elizabeth Sperry was born 17 JAN 1682/83 in New Haven, CT, and died 17 MAY 1760 in Wallingford, CT.
2 CONT * v.	Hannah Sperry was born 4 JAN 1685/86 in New Haven, CT.
2 CONT *  vi.	John Sperry was born 3 DEC 1691 in New Haven, CT, and died 10 MAR 1725/26 in New Haven, CT.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Elizabeth Post and Benjamin Bunnell is:
2 CONT *  i.	Anna Bunnell was born 11 OCT 1695 in New Haven, CT, and died 15 SEP 1731 in New Haven, CT.
2 CONT ===References
2 CONT *New England Marriages Prior to 1700 By Clarence Almon Torrey.  Page 226.   [https://books.google.com/books?id=mOgK8dM9qqUC&lpg=PA227&ots=ZiGl7iEJLf&dq=Ellen%20(Hadley)%20Dorman&pg=PA226#v=onepage&q=Ellen%20(Hadley)%20Dorman&f=fal
2 CONC se GoogleBooks]
