1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Spouse:
2 CONT Gervaise "Jarvis" Gilbert I
2 CONT 1680–1739 (m. 1716)
2 CONT
2 CONT Born in 1695 in Baltimore, Maryland. Married in 1716 to Gervaise (Jarvis) Gilbert as his second wife. Mary and Jarvis were the parents of ten children: Charles (1717-1720), Mary (1719-1720), Hannah (1721- ), Charles (1923-1797), A
2 CONC quila (1726-1806), Benjamin (1729-1791), Daniel (1731-1809) , Mary (1733-1785), Martha (1736-1799), and Arabella (1738- ). She was alive in 1739 when her late husband's will was probated and she was named as co-executor with son, 
2 CONC Michael Gilbert. She appears on the 1739 early Maryland census, but not afterwards, so her date of death is estimated at 1740. Since she and Jarvis were active in the Spesutia Church, we assume she was buried there along with him.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/99763429/mary-gilbert
