1 NOTE {geni:about_me} A Patriot of the American Revolution for VIRGINIA.  [http://services.dar.org/Public/DAR_Research/search_adb/?action=full&p_id=A045074  DAR  Ancestor #: A045074] 
2 CONT
2 CONT vi.   Benjamin Gilbert, born 1729 in Maryland; died November 1791 in Green County, Georgia. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Father could be [http://familytreemaker.genealogy.com/users/s/p/a/Michael-R-Spainhour/GENE1-0013.html Gavis Gilbert] - 
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for Garvis Gilbert , Sr:
2 CONT
2 CONT Garvis Gilbert (sometimes Gervais/Jarvis/Garvies/Garvis) may have been a son of Michael Gilbert and Dorothy Hargrave. If so, he was born 15 Apr 1680 at Leeds, Yorkshire, England. Marcum, The Way it Was with our Ancestors: “While t
2 CONC here has been no primary proof that Garvais who came to Maryland was their son, so much circumstantial evidence shows this to be true, that after careful analysis and intensive research by many different parties this is the only r
2 CONC easonable conclusion that can be drawn.” 
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife - second - is named Mary - first wife is Margaret- Bejamin comes from Mary
