2 CONC ords, pre-1870 (Barbour Collection), New London Vital Records 1646-1854, p 252. [http://interactive.ancestry.com/1034/VBMDUSACT1634_0029-0258/202904#?imageId=VBMDUSACT1634_0029-0260 Link to page at americanancestors.org].* Connect
2 CONC icut, Town Marriage Records, pre-1870 (Barbour Collection) for John Kenney, New London Vital Records 1646-1854. p. 437. [https://www.ancestry.com/interactive/1062/VBMDUSACT1634_0029-0445 Link to recordat ancestry.com].* Connecticu
2 CONC t, Town Marriage Records, pre-1870 (Barbour Collection) for John Kenney, New London Vital Records 1646-1854. p. 149.[https://www.ancestry.com/interactive/1062/VBMDUSACT1634_0029-0157 Link to record at ancestry.com].
