2 CONC n 1620.''  Vol. 1, p 15 [https://babel.hathitrust.org/cgi/pt?id=wu.89082506106;view=1up;seq=125 Link to page athathitrust.org].* Brown, Walter LeRoy and Brown, M. Theta Hakes. ''Ancestors of Florence Julia Brown: and some of their
2 CONC  descendants.'' Albion, NY: The Eddy Printing Co., 1940. p 176. [https://babel.hathitrust.org/cgi/pt?id=wu.89062878970;view=1up;seq=180 Link to page a hathitrust.org].
