1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.migenweb.org/allegan/ahnentafels/ccorkins.html
2 CONT
2 CONT Ezekial Turner, son of John Turner and MARY BREWSTER, was born 1/7/1650 and died on Jan 16,1704, at age 54. He married Susannah Kenney on Dec 26,1678 in Scituate,Ct and daughter LUCRETIA TURNER was born (pg 12)
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Ezekiel Turner's line continues with [http://www.geni.com/family-tree/index/6000000003938484344 this] Geni tree.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
