2 CONT '''Birth'''
2 CONT :Ezekiel Turner was born on 7 Jan 1650 at Scituate, Plymouth Colony.≤ref>Vital records of Scituate, Massachusetts, to the year 1850. Volume I – Births. (Boston, Mass. : New England Historic Genealogical Society, 1909) [https://arc
2 CONC hive.org/details/vitalrecordsofsc01newe/page/372/mode/2up p. 373]≤/ref> He was Christened on 19 JAN 1650  at Norwell church, Scituate, Plymouth, Massachusetts≤ref>Scituate, Mass. Second church. Scituate, Massachusetts: Second chur
2 CONC ch records (Boston: W. J. Litchfield, 1909) [https://archive.org/details/scituatemassachu00scit/page/2/mode/2up p. 2]≤/ref>
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Parents'''
2 CONT :Ezekiel is the son of [[Turner-2725|John Turner]] and [[Brewster-589|Mary Brewster]]. 
