2 CONT == Biography == This profile describes Ezekiel Turner, born in New London, Connecticut14 Apr 1698, who became the spouse of Borodell Denison on 12 May 1729, and with whom had at least 5 children. 
2 CONT Evidence should be cited to demonstrate that he may have previously been married to, and widowed from, Theoda Williams. According to the Wheeler (1900) ''History of Stonington'', the Theoda Williams who was baptized at Stonington 
2 CONC on 3 Jan 1700/01 did not marry.
2 CONT
