2 CONT == Biography ==
2 CONT Elizabeth Calkins, daughter of Stephen Calkins and Sarah Calkins Calkins (cousins). 
2 CONT She married Silas Peck. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Silas Peck and Elizabeth Caulkins are:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Silas Peck born about 1747. Dies about 1778
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.  Elizabeth Peck born about 1751
2 CONT
2 CONT 3.  Martha Peck born about 1753. Dies July 11, 1830.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4.  Louisa or_Lovisa Peck born about 1756. Dies August 6, 1828.
2 CONT
2 CONT 5.  Dan Peck born on 17 April 1762. Dies on 16 January 1839.
2 CONT
2 CONT 6.  Samuel Griffin Peck born 27 December 1766. Dies on 28 April 1851.
2 CONT
