2 CONT :Birth: 3-13-1731    LYME NEW LONDON CO CONNECTICUT 
2 CONT :Death: 10-28-1814     DANBY RUTLAND CO VERMONT :Service Source: GOODRICH, ROLLS OF THE SOLS IN THE REV WAR 1775-1783,P 92, 163, 197, 372, 373
2 CONT :Service Description: 1) COLS EBENEZER ALLEN, IRA ALLEN 
2 CONT :Spouse: Rebecca Rowland:Children in file: Stephen who m. Saphronia Barrett m. 2nd Phoebe Vail; Richard who m. Ruth Allen.≤ref>{{DAR-grs|A018336|CALKINS, STEPHEN CALKINS |July 9, 2019}} [[Meehan-411]] ≤/ref>
