2 CONT == Biography =='''Zerviah Calkins''' was born on March 10, 1742 in Lyme, Connecticut Colony, daughter of [[Calkins-116|Stephen Calkins]] (1701–1753) and [[Calkins-530|Sarah Calkins]] (1702–1774).
2 CONT Zerviah (19) married '''[[Wait-360|Lowen Wait]]''' (18) (born on August 20, 1743) on November 3, 1761 in Lyme, New London, Connecticut. Their children were:
2 CONT * [[Wait-1162|Martin Wait]] (1764–>1855)
2 CONT * [[Wait-1255|Esther Wait]] (1765–~1837)
2 CONT
2 CONT Zerviah died about 1802, aged about 59.
2 CONT
