1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Pember, baptized July 4, 1742, son of Thomas Caulkins deceased, married Abigail Bliss of Norwich, daughter of Samuel Bliss, on Dec 7, 1766. She died June 3, 1777, and is buried in the Brown Cem in Griswold CT. He t
2 CONC hen married Joanna Perkins, born abt 1733, and married her Jan 6, 1780. She died in 1811. He then, according to the Hale listing, married another Abigail, born abt 1766. She died in 1814. The children of Pember and his first wife 
2 CONC Abigail are: Elizabeth b. April 13, 1775 d. May 25, 1808 Ezra b. Aug 24, 1767 d. Sept 25, 1795 John b. Oct 28, 1768 d. Jan 15, 1794 Mary b. Jan 16, 1772 d. Aug 14, 1773 Silas b. May 9, 1770 d. July 9, 1807 William b. Nov 13, 1773 
