2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Thomas is identified as Thomas Abbe or Abbey of Enfiled, Hampshire Co., Massachussetts in 1703 when it appears that he has his father declared as dying intestate (therefore it seems likely brother John is dead). This is interestin
2 CONC g  as  John Sr.'s will which stated John Jr.'s  wife and her heirs should inherit his estate.
2 CONT
2 CONT Walter Fairfiield and Thomas O. Edward witness.Daniel Rogers, Francis Crumpton witness. Probate judge John Appleton. Thomas and his brothers and sisters settled their estate dispute in 1704.
2 CONT --------------------
