1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/159040914/john-abbe '''John Abbe - Find A Grave'''] - Memorial ID: 159040914	
2 CONT
2 CONT From the book published in 1916 "Abbe -Abbey Genealogy In Memory of John Abbe and his Descendants" by Cleveland Abbe and Joseph Genung Nichols
2 CONT
2 CONT JOHN ABBE, son of Thomas and Sarah (Fairfield) Abbe, born in Enfield, Conn., September 27, 1692; died 1790, in or near Hartford, Conn. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was a farmer, known as one of the first settlers of Upper King Street, Enfield;received a land grant, February 18, 1716-7. He is mentioned as a lieutenant, 1786-1791, and held various minor offices in the town. John Abbe is pos
2 CONC s4 of A peace of Meadow by Alienation from Richard French lying west of Jobes hill so Called Bounded North partly by A swamp and partly by lapland, and south East and west by upland being in length East and west 160 rods and in br
2 CONC eadth North and south 3 rods one peace with an other being by Estimation one acre and 1/2 be it more or less. Feby 18th 1716:17. (Enfield records.)
2 CONT
2 CONT With his brother Thomas and sisters Sarah Gears and Tabitha Warriner he signed a receipt for a legacy from his grandfather, Walter Fairfield, January 6,1725-6. (Essex Deeds, 49:190.)
2 CONT
2 CONT Married HANNAH BOARDMAN, born in Wethersfield, Conn., December 18, 1693, daughter of David and Hannah (Wright) Boardman or Boreman, granddaughter of Samuel and Mary (Betts) Boreman and great-granddaughter of Christopher Boreman of
2 CONC  Clayton, England, and his wife, Julian Carter.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children, born in Enfield<br/>
2 CONT 1 - John (1) Abbe, bapt. in Wethersfield, 1715 or 1716<br/>
2 CONT 2 - John (2) Abbe, b. April 18, 1717<br/>
2 CONT 3 - Hannah Abbe, b. April 19, 1719<br/>
2 CONT 4 - Thomas Abbe, b. Dec. 18, 1721<br/>
2 CONT 5 - Sarah Abbe, b. Dec. (or Jan.) 23, 1723-4<br/>
2 CONT 6 - Daniel Abbe, b. May 8, 1726<br/>
2 CONT   7 - Martha Abbe, b. March (or May) 1, 1728<br/>
2 CONT 8 - Mary Abbe, b. May 14, 1730.<br/>
2 CONT 9 - Tabitha Abbe. b. March 9, 1732 <br/>
2 CONT 10- Richard Abbe, b. Aug. 1, 1735.<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT Bio by: [https://www.findagrave.com/user/profile/47644196 Gone Too Soon]
2 CONT
