1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT Thomas was born in 1623 Heavitree, Devon, England. He was orphaned at a young age. His uncle who was his guardian sent him to America along with his brother in 1635, keeping their sizable inheritance for himself. They arrived in B
2 CONC oston with no money. He arrived in Enfield Ct in 1682 one of the first settlers. He was a tanner, farmer and town moderator. He married Deborah Davis and had at least 3 children. He died at age 99 in 1722.
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth
2 CONT
2 CONT 1623 Heavitree, Devon, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Christening
2 CONT
2 CONT Heavitree, Devon, England Burial
2 CONT
2 CONT JAN 1722 Enfield, Hartford, Conn
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Geer-35
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas Geer (1623 - 1722)
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas Geer
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 1623 in Heavitree, Devon, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Jonathan Geer and Eleanor (Geere) Geer
2 CONT
2 CONT Brother of George Geer
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Deborah (Davis) Geer — married 1668 in Yarmouth, Massachusetts
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Mary (Geer) Prior and Shubael Geer Sr.
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 14 Jan 1722 in Enfield, Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT Profile last modified 4 Jul 2018 | Created 25 Sep 2010
2 CONT
