1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Dea. Edward Morris=
2 CONT * BIRTH 10 Mar 1658 Roxbury, Suffolk County, Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT * DEATH 29 Aug 1727 (aged 69) Woodstock, Windham County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * BURIAL Woodstock Hill Cemetery, Woodstock, Windham County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * MEMORIAL ID  11446911 Pictures added by msimonds & Sandra
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Lieut. Deacon Edward Morris (1630-1690) and Grace Bett ( -1705). Baptized 13 Mar. (1658 or 1659) at Roxbury, Mass. Married Elizabeth Bowen 24 May 1683 at Roxbury, Mass.  Among the first settlers of Woodstock, CT.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Inscription'''
2 CONT HERE LIES BURIED THE 
2 CONT BODY OF DEACON EDWARD
2 CONT MORRIS, AGED 69 YEARS
2 CONT DECEASED AUGUST 29 
2 CONT 1727
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Parents'''
2 CONT Lieut Edward Morris 1632–1690
2 CONT Grace Bett Morris 1634–1705
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Spouse'''
2 CONT Elizabeth Bowen Morris 1661–1743 (m. 1683)
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Siblings'''
2 CONT Susannah Morris Clayton 1654–1710
2 CONT Grace Morris Child 1661–1723
2 CONT Lieut Ebenezer Morris 1664–1718
2 CONT Elizabeth Morris Child 1666–1752
2 CONT Margaret Morris Johnson 1668–1750
2 CONT Samuel Morris 1671–1745
2 CONT Martha Philbrick Morris Lyon 1675–1756
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children'''
2 CONT Lieut Edward Morris 1688–1769
2 CONT Prudence Morris Belknap 1702–1780
2 CONT
2 CONT ==References==
2 CONT 1. https://connecticutgenealogy.com/windham/early_settlement_of_woodstock.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/11446911/edward_morris#view-photo=3186249
