1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Grace Morris Child=
2 CONT * BIRTH 7 Feb 1661 Roxbury, Suffolk County, Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT * DEATH 10 Dec 1723 (aged 62) Roxbury, Suffolk County, Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT * BURIAL Walter Street Burying Ground, Roslindale, Suffolk County, Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT * PLOT WSt2
2 CONT * MEMORIAL ID 25155606 Pictures added by BSN & Bio by Fr. Timothy Ferguson
2 CONT
2 CONT She was born 7 Feb 1660/1. [3]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Inscription'''
2 CONT Here Lyes the Body
2 CONT of GRACE CHILD
2 CONT The Wife of
2 CONT BENJAMIN CHILD
2 CONT Died Dec. ye 10th
2 CONT 1 7 2 3
2 CONT In the 63rd year
2 CONT of Her Age.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Notes'''
2 CONT Based on her recorded baptism at Roxbury and the manner in which her age at death is stated, on the date Grace died she was 62 years old, and Ætatis suæ (i.e., Æ, "Aged," in the XX year of her Age) 63. This indicated she was b. AF
2 CONC TER Dec. 10, 1660. She was bapt. of record at Roxbury Feb. 17, 1660/1 by the Reverend John Eliot, the "blessed apostle" to the New England native tribes and founder of the Roxbury Latin School.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Parents'''
2 CONT Lieut Edward Morris 1632–1690
2 CONT Grace Bett Morris 1634–1705
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Spouse'''
2 CONT Capt. Benjamin Child III 1658–1723 (m. 1683)
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Siblings'''
2 CONT Susannah Morris Clayton 1654–1710
2 CONT Dea. Edward Morris 1658–1727
2 CONT Lieut. Ebenezer Morris 1664–1718
2 CONT Elizabeth Morris Child 1666–1752
2 CONT Margaret Morris Johnson 1668–1750
2 CONT Samuel Morris 1671–1745
2 CONT Martha Philbrick Morris Lyon 1675–1756
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children''' 12x
2 CONT Ephraim Child 3/7/1684–1759 m Priscilla Harris
2 CONT Capt. Benjamin Child IV 7/19/1685–1771 m Patience Thayer 
2 CONT Edward Child 11/1687 m 1/2/1712 Margaret Weld 
2 CONT Grace Child Walker 10/27/1689–1729 m Timothy Walker of Rehoboth
2 CONT Mary Child 10/25/1691- m Peter Walker of Rehoboth 
2 CONT Ebenezer Child 9/7/1693- m Elizabeth Bacon Jan 25 1720 
2 CONT Martha Child 10/5/695- d unmarried 
2 CONT William Child 10/14/1697–1770 m Deborah Goddard 
2 CONT Capt Penuel Child b Sept 3 1699–1756
2 CONT Richard Child 10/22/1701–1759
2 CONT Dea. Thomas Child 11/10/1703–1782 m 9/27/1729 Anna Morris 
2 CONT Margaret Child 5/26/1706-4/20/1775 unmarried
2 CONT
