1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Margaret was born Sep 25 1668 in Roxbury; she was the daughter of Edward and Grace Bett/Bell Morris;[1] She married John Johnson there on April 4, 1689.[2] She died Aug 12 1750 in Woodstock, Connecticut.[3]
2 CONT
2 CONT She is buried in Woodstock Hill Cemetery, Woodstock, Windham, CT
