2 CONT ==Martha (Morris) Lyon (1675 - 1756)==
2 CONT
2 CONT Martha Lyon formerly Morris
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 30 Jan 1675 in Roxbury, Suffolk, Massachusetts Bay Colony
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of Edward Morris and Grace (Bett) Morris
2 CONT
2 CONT Sister of Isaac Morris, Edward Morris II, Grace (Morris) Child, Ebenezer Morris, Elizabeth (Morris) Child, Margaret (Morris) Johnson and Samuel Morris I
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of William Lyon — married 6 Jan 1715 in Woodstock, Windham, Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother of Nehemiah Lyon
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 9 May 1756 in Woodstock, Windham, Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Martha was the daughter of Edward and Grace Bett/Bell Morris; she was born at Roxbury in 1674.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Martha Morriss married William Lyon on January 6, 1714-15 in Woodstock, Windham County, Connecticut.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Death Date: 9 MAY 1756; Woodstock, Windham, Connecticut[3]
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT
