1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Davis-32733
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Abigail Davis was born about 1688 in Roxbury, Massachusetts. The Roxbury Vital Records lists her father as a resident of Muddy River, a section that became incorporated as Brookline in 1705. Abigail and her sister, Rachel, were no
2 CONC t listed in the Roxbury Vital Records but it is clear that they were Joseph’s children.
2 CONT
2 CONT Abigail married Jeremiah Sabin, son of Benjamin and Sarah (Parker) Sabin, on 8 May 1712 at Woodstock, Windham, CT - parents of Samuel, Uriah, Jeremiah II, Moses, Abigail, Aaron, Hannah, David and Hezekiah Sabin
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Sources
2 CONT * https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Sabin-410
2 CONT *William Sabin and his Descendants 1609-2000 Compiled by Gordan Allen Morris and Philip Sabin Hubbard p. 13
2 CONT * The Complete Ancestry of Tennessee Williams by John A Brayton (1993) p. 37
