2 CONT
2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT Joseph Griffin Jr was born 2 Jan 1694 Roxbury, Suffolk County, MA the son of Joseph & Sarah (Devotion) Griffin and married Margarett Morris on 15 March 1721 in Woodstock, Windham, Connecticut before he passed away before 1735.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Notes==
2 CONT This profile originally said he was born about 1705. Since he married in 1721, it would be more natural that his birth year would have been 1700 or earlier. Most men in this era married at about age 25.
2 CONT
2 CONT His profile on familysearch.org says this is his birth record, below. If so, then he may be the same as Joseph Griffin (1694-abt.1768), or the two profiles have been conflated: Joseph, son of Joseph Griffin & Sarah, was born on 2 
2 CONC Jan 1694? in Roxbury, Boston, Suffolk, Massachusetts Bay Colony.[3] The dates on this profile have been changed to match those attributed to him on familysearch.org and its sources. If you have data and sources, or alternate theor
2 CONC ies, please add them.
2 CONT
