2 CONT Ephraim Hyde (1707 - 1761)
2 CONT
2 CONT Ephraim Hyde
2 CONT Born 3 Aug 1707 in Newton, Middlesex, Province of Massachusetts Baymap
2 CONT ANCESTORS ancestors
2 CONT Son of Jonathan Hyde and Elizabeth (Williams) Hyde
2 CONT Brother of Isaac Hyde, Enoch Hyde, Nathaniel Hyde, Dorothy (Hyde) Cleveland, Elizabeth Hyde, Jonathan Hyde, David Hyde, Ebenezer Hyde and John Hyde
2 CONT Husband of Margaret (Morris) Hyde — married 7 Aug 1735 in Pomfret, Windham, Connecticutmap
2 CONT DESCENDANTS descendants
2 CONT Father of Margaret (Hyde) Perrin and Ephraim Hyde
2 CONT Died 5 Dec 1761 at age 54 in Pomfret, Windham, Connecticut Colonymap
2 CONT PROBLEMS/QUESTIONSProfile manager: Patricia Kent private message [send private message]
2 CONT Profile last modified 7 Jan 2023 | Created 13 Sep 2019
2 CONT This page has been accessed 86 times.
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Ephraim was born in 1707. He was the son of Jonathan Hyde and Elizabeth Williams.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ephraim Hyde married Margaret (Morris) Griffin, the widow of Joseph Griffin, as her second husband in Pomfret, Connecticut, on 7 August 1735. [1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Ephraim Hyde died in Pomfret on 5 December 1761, and Margaret was living as his widow as of 28 December 1761, when his estate was divided.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
