2 CONT Seth Paine (1690 - 1772)  Born 20 Aug 1690 in Rehoboth, Bristol, Massachusetts Bay  Son of Samuel Paine and Annie (Peck) Paine  Brother of Samuel Paine, Anne Paine, Sarah Paine, Judith (Paine) Peck, Noah Paine, Stephen Paine, Dani
2 CONC el Paine, Rebecca Paine [half] and Ebenezer Paine [half]  Husband of Mary (Morris) Paine — married 3 Jun 1719 in Pomfret, Connecticut  Father of Seth Paine, Mary (Paine) Chaplin, Hannah (Paine) Spaulding, Elijah Paine, Joseph Pain
2 CONC e, Sarah Paine, John Paine, Margaret Paine and Joshua Paine  Died 18 Jan 1772 in Pomfret, Windham, Connecticut
