1 NAME Anne /unknown/
2 GIVN Anne
2 SURN unknown
2 _MARNM CummIngs
2 NICK Margaret
2 NICK Green
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1605
2 PLAC Mistley, Essex, England
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE BEF 8 MAY 1677
2 PLAC Topsfield, Essex, Massachuetts
2 ADDR
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT ===Family
2 CONT
2 CONT https://mathcs.clarku.edu/~djoyce/gen/report/rr01/rr01_457.html#P62148
2 CONT
2 CONT Isaac Cummings married Anne. Anne died in Topsfield, MA ca 1677.
2 CONT
2 CONT Their children include:
2 CONT
2 CONT #Isaac Cummings (Died soon) (ca 1629-May 1629)
2 CONT #John Cummings (ca 1630-1 Dec 1700)
2 CONT #Dea. Isaac Cummings (ca 1632/3-Jan 1721)
2 CONT #Anne Cummings (ca 1634/5-29 Jun 1689)
2 CONT #Elizabeth Cummings (ca 1637-9 Jul 1679)
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Notes
2 CONT
2 CONT Matrimony was solemnised the [Blank] Daie of [Blank] Between [Blank] Commins and Amy Greene Daughter of John Grene of much-birch. [also known as Great Birch]
2 CONT
2 CONT Considering: 1) the proximity of Copford and Easthorpe, 2) no other marriage for John has been found, 3) the children of John began after this marriage, and 4) John owned land in Copford (see below), this is probably the marriage 
2 CONC of John Commin, the father of children in both parishes.
2 CONT
2 CONT The three most authoritative books on Isaac's family are:
2 CONT
2 CONT •ISAAC CUMMINGS, OF TOPSFIELD, MASS. AND SOME OF HIS DESCENDANTS, Miss Marietta Clark, Mrs. Abbie W.Towne, W. F. Cummings and George Francis Dow, published 1899 by the Topsfield Historical Society
2 CONT
2 CONT •CUMMINGS MEMORIAL, George W. Mooar, published 1903 New York, by B. F. Cummings
2 CONT
2 CONT •CUMMINGS GENEALOGY, Albert Oren Cummins, published 1904 Montpelier, Vermont.
2 CONT
2 CONT All three books stated the name of Isaac Cummings' wife was not known. However, various family collections have given her name as Mary, Marie,Margaret or Elizabeth. Since no evidence for a second marriage has been published, let u
2 CONC s hope that Anne will be accepted as Isaac's wife.
1 FAMS @F6000000001047644096@
1 RFN geni:6000000001047512551
1 SUBM @S6000000000979767217@
1 OBJE
