2 CONT General Notes: The widow Margaret continued to live in Great Baddow for ten years. Robert, the elder son, had wife Lydia. Vol II, 93. Wife Margaret emmigrated to America in the years just prior to her death. 1 Robert married Marga
2 CONC ret [perhaps KING, daughter of Francis KING and UNKNOWN], in 1586 in Great Baddow, Essex, England. Margaret was born in 1573-1574 in Great Baddow, Essex, England and died on 1 Sep 1644 in Salem, Essex, MA at age 70. 
