2 CONT 2.	Robert PEASE Jr. (Great Baddow)	bapt.
2 CONT 28 Oct 1589 in Great Baddow, England	Lydia WEST England.
2 CONT .
2 CONT Marie [French?]
2 CONT England.	7 Oct 1644 Salem, Mass.
2 CONT 3.	William Pease	bapt.
2 CONT 26 Sep 1591
