2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT On June 5, 1638, she was sentenced by the General Court to be set in the bilboes, two hours in Boston, 
2 CONT and two hours in Salem upon a lecture day, and was also banished to Rhode Island.
2 CONT
2 CONT Prior to her death, she became "of hopelessly unsound mind"
