2 CONT Brief Life History of John
2 CONT
2 CONT When John Pease was christened on 20 November 1608, in Great Baddow, Essex, England, United Kingdom, his father, Robert Pease, was 43 and his mother, Margaret King, was 38. He married Lucy Weston in 1637, in Martha's Vineyard, Wes
2 CONC t Tisbury, Dukes, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 2 sons. He immigrated to Salem, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America in 1634. He died on 3 June 1689, in Edgarto
2 CONC wn, Dukes, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, at the age of 80.
