2 CONT Brief Life History of Elizabeth
2 CONT
2 CONT When Elizabeth Pease was born on 20 August 1662, in Salem, Essex, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, her father, Robert Pease, was 32 and her mother, Sarah, was 28. She married Thomas Venney on 28 October 1703, in
2 CONC  Marblehead, Essex, Massachusetts, United States. They were the parents of at least 2 sons and 3 daughters.
