2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Pease was born August 20 1662 at Salem Mass to Robert Pease and Sara.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Could this Elizabeth be the wife of Hugh Makkoway? Married at Salem 1701.[2] She would of given birth to one child around age 40 before Mr Makkoway died in 1704 (this from a close look at the image associated with this record).
2 CONT
2 CONT Research Note
2 CONT
2 CONT Makkaway could be an early spelling for the English name: Mackaway
2 CONT
