1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://ancestors.familysearch.org/en/L4Y9-WF4/nathaniel-pease-1677...
2 CONT
2 CONT Brief Life History of Nathaniel
2 CONT
2 CONT When Nathaniel Pease was born on 28 December 1677, in Salem, Essex, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, his father, Robert Pease, was 47 and his mother, Sarah Sedgwick, was 43. He married Elizabeth Ashby in Septemb
2 CONC er 1701, in Salem, Essex, Massachusetts, United States. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 2 daughters. He lived in Massachusetts, United States in 1677. In 1736, his occupation is listed as laborer in Salem, Essex, Mass
2 CONC achusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America. He died in June 1737, in Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, at the age of 59.
