2 CONC ale-thurston.  " ... John was a son of Zachariah Goodale who was born in 1639 and who married '''Elizabeth Bercham''' (sic). Zachariah was a son of Robert Goodale, who embarked at Ipswich, England, with his wife Katherine in April
2 CONC , 1634 ...”
