2 CONC ought of John Smith, of Salem, 28 Jan., 1658, house and land, 1 a., at Salem. (Salem Series, 1:48.) Birth date & place have not been proven, nor has his parentage. < [http://books.google.com/books?id=rqvWQWtFKl0C&pg=PA371 GoogleBo
