2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Zachariah Goodell was born on February 9, 1667, in Salem, Essex County, Massachusetts.[1][2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Zachariah married Sarah Whipple in Salem, first birth mentioned in record is august 1693[3]
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: He died sometime between the date of his will, 21 May 1721, and the date it was proved, 26 June 1727.[4] His only son received the homestead.
2 CONT Zachariah and Sarah had six children.
2 CONT Sources
