1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Goodell-490
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph Goodell or Goodale,third son of Zachariah Goodale (1640-1715) and Elizabeth (Beauchamp) Goodale (1648-1715), was born on September 23, 1672 [1], at Salem, Essex, Massachusetts. Joseph was a carpenter. On 6 April 1694, Josep
2 CONC h married Mary probably surnamed Sampson, though this assertion remains unproven; this marriage was also at Salem, Mass. [2] His will was written on 5 Feb 1717/8 and proved 14 March thus establishing his death to have occurred wit
2 CONC hin this range of dates, probably the second week of March 1718. His will names a few family members; namely his wife, his brother John Walcott, his son Joseph Jr. to whom he bequeathed the family homestead, and four daughters. [3
2 CONC ]
2 CONT
2 CONT Family of Joseph and Mary Goodale
2 CONT
2 CONT The children of Joseph and Mary Goodale have been tabulated in the published genealogical work Walter Goodwin Davis; [3] < [https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=Xib7NfnK11s&mid=50138&murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ancestry.com%2Fimag
2 CONC eviewer%2Fcollections%2F48193%2Fimages%2FMAMEFamiliesII-003011-43 Ancestry.com] > and his text provides the following account of their children:
2 CONT
2 CONT # Edward Goodale; born 4 May 1695; died 1 June 1709.
2 CONT # Mary Goodale; born 5 July 1696; 24 Oct 1713 announced intent to marry John Wilkins III; died prior to 1718.
2 CONT # Ruth Goodale; born 11 Feb 1698/9; 21 Oct 1724 married Nathaniel Esty.
2 CONT # Keturah Goodale; born 11 Oct 1701; 4 Nov 1724 Jonathan Goodale.
2 CONT #  Sarah Goodale; born 8 Apr 1704; 23 Feb 1727 married Ebenezer Upton of Reading.
2 CONT # Elizabeth Goodale; born 7 Aug 1706; 26 Feb1728/9 married Solomon Richardson of Middleton.
2 CONT #  Joseph Goodale (i); born 4 Feb 1709/10; died young.
2 CONT # Joseph Goodale (ii) Jr.; born 20 July 1711; Ezekiel Cleever appointed guardian 4 Apr 1726; 26 Sept 1733 married Elizabeth Goodale at Sudbury.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References 
2 CONT # https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/4:1:LCM7-Z76
2 CONT # WikiTree contributors, "Joseph Goodell (1672-bef.1718)," WikiTree: The Free Family Tree, (https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Goodell-490 : accessed 10 December 2025). cites
