2 CONC . Ancestry.com Operations Inc, Provo, UT, USA, 2012. New England Marriages prior to 1700; at American Ancestors. IMPORTANT NOTE American Ancestors cites the version of Torrey which includes Torrey's Source References, the version 
2 CONC at Ancestry does not! Torrey uses a coded abbreviation for his source citations; a cross reference manual which expands Torrey's abbreviations into a title string having sufficient information to perform a source verification sear
2 CONC ch may be found [http://freepages.rootsweb.com/~brouwergenealogydata/genealogy/Docs/torrey%20sources%20(nehgr).pdf HERE].  Print edition. This manuscript is still in print and may be available at Amazon.com or Abebooks.com or othe
2 CONC r rare booksellers. Note the edition without the references is a single volume, with references is a multivolume set.
