1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From http://freepages.history.rootsweb.ancestry.com/~historyofmarlborough/genigoodale.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT 4.  BENJAMIN3 GOODALE (ZACHARIA2, ROBERT1) was born July 04, 1687 in Salem, Massachusetts, and died 1754.  He married HANNAH _____ Bef. 1711 in Marlborough, Massachusetts. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of BENJAMIN GOODALE and HANNAH _____ are: 
2 CONT *                  i. ELIZABETH4 GOODALE, b. February 26, 1711, Marlborough, Massachusetts; m. EBENEZER HARTHORN, April 30, 1730, Marlborough, Massachusetts. 
2 CONT *                  ii. PHINEAS GOODALE, b. May 01, 1713, Marlborough, Massachusetts; m. REBECCA BRUCE, 1733, Woburn, Massachusetts; b. Woburn, Massachusetts. 
2 CONT *                  iii. EDWARD GOODALE, b. May 23, 1715, Marlborough, Massachusetts; m. SARAH TEMPLE; b. Shrewsbury, Massachusetts. They had a son Notes for EDWARD GOODALE: Removed to Shrewsbury.
2 CONT *                  iv. HANNAH GOODALE, b. May 03, 1717, Marlborough, Massachusetts; m. JOHN TAINTER. 
2 CONT *                  v. MARY GOODALE, b. April 30, 1719, Marlborough, Massachusetts; m. JOSIAH HOWE, August 12, 1741, Marlborough, Massachusetts; b. December 22, 1714, Marlborough, Massachusetts. 
2 CONT *                  vi. RUTH GOODALE, b. July 10, 1721, Marlborough, Massachusetts; m. JOSEPH GARY, April 16, 1741, Marlborough, Massachusetts; b. Princton, Massachusetts. 
