2 CONT The Life Summary of John
2 CONT
2 CONT When John Smith was born in 1623, in Salem, Essex, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, his father, Sir Thomas Smith, was 34 and his mother, Lady Anne Sayer, was 32. He married Elizabeth Goodale about 1657, in Salem
2 CONC , Essex, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 4 daughters. He died on 10 October 1672, in Ipswich, Essex, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, at the age o
2 CONC f 49.
