2 CONC Salem/6000000016697306919. Henry Bennett of Ipswitch had a brother William and unknown parent. He married firs to Lydia and had Jacob, John, William, Henry, Thomas, Stephen and Benjamin. He married second to Mary Smith. He and his
2 CONC  children did not go to CT. The other Henry is of CT and did not marry Lydia Perkins. Henry of CT was possibly son of Roger. Both men had sons named Henry. Henry II of Ipswich married Francis Burr and Margaret. He had children Mar
2 CONC y, Frances, Margaret, Joanna and Lucy. Henry II of Lyme, Saybrook Colony CT married Sarah Champion and had Caleb, Rose, John, Love, Dorothy and Henry. 
