1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Richard Adams 
2 CONT * Sex: M 
2 CONT * Birth: 19 APR 1651 in Scituate, Plymouth County, Massachusetts '''(see source Record)'''
2 CONT * Ref; Christened: 27 Apr 1651, Scituate, Plymouth Co. Massachusetts 
2 CONT * Death: 24 AUG 1728 in Norwich, New London Co. Connecticut 
2 CONT * Note:  Ref; AFN: HMC-S5
2 CONT * Father: James Adams b: 17 DEC 1630 in Plymouth, Plymouth Co. Massachusetts 
2 CONT * Mother: Frances Vassall b: 1623 in Stepheny, Middlesex, England
2 CONT * Marriage 1 Rebecca Davis b: ABT 1661 in Of, Sudbury, Middlesex Co. Massachusetts Married: 24 JUN 1679 in Sudbury, Middlesex Co. Massachusetts
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT *  Richard Adams b: 11 APR 1680 in Sudbury, Middlesex Co. Massachusetts
2 CONT *  Rebecca Adams b: 3 FEB 1680/81 in Sudbury, Middlesex Co. Massachusetts
2 CONT *  Sarah Adams b: 8 MAY 1683 in Sudbury, Middlesex Co. Massachusetts
2 CONT *  John Adams , Sr. b: 26 OCT 1686 in Sudbury, Middlesex Co. Massachusetts
2 CONT *  Daniel Adams b: 4 MAR 1686/87 in Sudbury, Middlesex Co. Massachusetts
2 CONT *  William Adams b: 29 JAN 1687/88 in Sudbury, Middlesex Co. Massachusetts
2 CONT *  Joseph Adams b: BET 1694 AND 1696 in Sudbury, Middlesex Co. Massachusetts
2 CONT *  Isaac Adams , Dr. b: 1696 in Sudbury, Middlesex Co. Massachusetts
2 CONT *  Mary Adams b: ABT 1698 in Sudbury, Middlesex Co. Massachusetts
2 CONT *  Hannah Adams b: 1708 in Sudbury, Middlesex Co. Massachusetts
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Notes 
2 CONT
2 CONT Fought in King Phillips War. Was in 2nd Co Mass. Volunteer from Sudbury Mass under Capt Moseley. He was at the Battle of Bloody Brook 9-18-1675. He was wounded at Swamp Fort Battle in RI 12-19-1675 against King Phillip-Narraganset
2 CONC  Indians.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Sources 
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage to Rebecca Davis: (24 Jun 1679 â Age: 28) Sudbury, Middlesex, Massachusetts, USA* Updated from [http://trees.ancestry.com/tree/58139821/person/32497040770 Ancestry Genealogy] via son [http://www.geni.com/profile-3467812
2 CONC 3476 John Adams] by [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Sep 18 2015, 0:57:09 UTC''
