1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Edward Woollen/Wooland and Margery Pasco had a daughter, Sarah Wooland, who married Hugh Pasco . They have two daughters, Sarah, b 1671, and Margery, b 1673. Hugh then married Mary Pease and produced the forebears 
2 CONC bearing that name in this country today -- that is, those who trace their ancestry back to Hugh.
