1 NOTE {geni:about_me} During the French and Indian War he served in August of 1757, under Captain Jonathan Pettibone in the expedition against Fort Edward. On May 4, 1769 he signed the petition to the General Assembly of Connecticut req
2 CONC uesting the right to form the Second Ecclesiastical Society of Enfield, having signed the covenant of that church on August 20, 1762. He was chosen Moderator at a meeting of the Society on April 19, 1799. He was chosen surveyor of
2 CONC  highways for the town, December3, 1781, and was key keeper in 1798, 1799, 1802 and 1803.
2 CONT
