2 DATE 2 MAR 1703
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Simeon Booth
2 CONT * b. 10 May 1641<br/>
2 CONT * d. 28 Feb 1703, Hartford, CT.
2 CONT * Parents: Robert Booth & his 1st wife
2 CONT
2 CONT Married:<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT *1st on 5 Jan 1664: Rebecca Frost, daughter of Daniel, b. abt 1640, d. 25 Dec 1688, Enfield, CT<br/>
2 CONT * 2nd on 8 Dec 1693: Elizabeth, widow of Samuel Elmer. She died 26 Jan 1727 in Hartford, CT.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children with Rebecca:
2 CONT
2 CONT * William, 1664
2 CONT * Zachariah, 1666
2 CONT * Elizabeth, 1668
2 CONT * Mary, 1670
2 CONT * Bridget, 1670
2 CONT
2 CONT Children with Elizabeth:
2 CONT
2 CONT * Sarah, 1695
2 CONT * Phoebe, 1697
2 CONT
2 CONT Rcvd Land Grant of 35 acres in Enfield in 1680. 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT (1) Jacobus, Donald Lines, The Genealogy of the Booth Family, Pleasant Hill, MO: Eden C. Booth, 1952, pp. 117-118:
2 CONT
2 CONT SIMEON BOOTH . . . born perhaps in England, or in Exeter, N. Y., 10 May 1641, died at Hartford, Conn., 28 Feb. 1702/3; married first, perhaps at Fairfield, Conn., 5 Jan. 1663, Rebecca Frost, born about 1640, died at Enfield, Conn.
2 CONC , 25 Dec. 168[8], aged 48, daughter of Daniel Frost; married second, at Enfield, 8 Dec. 1693, Elizabeth (_____) Elmer, born about 1654, died at Hartford, Conn., 26 Jan. 1727 [note by compiler: there is no record of that death is f
2 CONC ound at Hartford], widow of Samuel Elmer.
2 CONT
2 CONT He sold his home farm in Saco, 8 Oct. 1675, to Major Pendleton. On 10 Mar. 1679, he was received into the church at Salem, Mass. Freeman, 19 May 1680. He soon moved to Enfield, where he was constable and selectman.
2 CONT
2 CONT His will, dated 23 Feb. 1702/3, was made by word of mouth in his last illness. He named his two sons, William and Zachariah; to Zachariah's son Robert, his loom; thirty shillings to his daughter Phebe; small amounts to three daugh
2 CONC ters, Brid-get Allen, Elizabeth Peese, and Mary Spencer; remainder to wife and child Sarah "that he had by her."
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT *Source: One Branch of the Booth Family: Showing the Lines of Connection with One ... By Charles Edwin Booth < [https://books.google.com/books?id=r781AAAAMAAJ&pg=PA138&dq=simeon+booth+m.+rebecca&hl=en&sa=X&ved=0ahUKEwjpwNS27anLAhV
2 CONC T0GMKHdNpD3AQ6AEIHTAA#v=onepage&q=simeon%20booth%20m.%20rebecca&f=false GoogleBooks] >
2 CONT * GEDCOM Source FamilySearch Family Three(https://www.familysearch.org)  The Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints, "FamilySearch Family Tree," database,  FamilySearch   (https://www.familysearch.org) accessed 25 Jan 2019), 
2 CONC entry for Simeon Booth, person ID LRZ6-DNX.  3
2 CONT * https://www.frostandgilchrist.com/getperson.php?personID=I5477&tree=frostinaz01
2 CONT * (1) Jacobus, Donald Lines, The Genealogy of the Booth Family, Pleasant Hill, MO: Eden C. Booth, 1952, p. 117:
