1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Zechariah Booth=
2 CONT * BIRTH 1669
2 CONT * DEATH 28 May 1741 (aged 71–72) Enfield, Hartford County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * BURIAL Enfield Street Cemetery, Enfield, Hartford County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * MEMORIAL ID 72942463 
2 CONT
2 CONT Zechariah married Mary Warriner on July 15, 1691 in Hadley, Massachusetts. They had one child Robert.  After the death of his first wife Mary Warriner Booth, he went on to marry another woman named Mary Harmon. Mary and Zechariah 
2 CONC had about 8 children.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Parents'''
2 CONT Simon Booth 1641–1703
2 CONT Rebecca Frost Booth
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Spouses'''
2 CONT Mary Warriner Booth 1669–1692
2 CONT Mary Hannah Harmon Booth 1671–1742
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Siblings'''
2 CONT William Booth 1664–1753
2 CONT Elizabeth Booth Pease 1669–1723
2 CONT Bridget Booth Allen 1672–1714
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children''' with Mary Booth*, Mary Harmon**
2 CONT *Robert Booth 1692–1714
2 CONT **John Booth 1697–1778
2 CONT **Sarah Booth Pease 1703–1792
2 CONT **Elizabeth Booth Allyn 1705–1751 
2 CONT **Jemima Booth Pease 1708–1772
2 CONT
