2 CONC ith, 4- Erastus Smith, 5- Cyntha Smith, 6- Clarissa Smith, 7- Harvy Smith, b. May 20, 1796; m. Maria Sacket. 8- Sally Smith, b. Jan. 20, 1798; m. Jared Dowd. 9- Ira Smith, 10- Daniel Phelps Smith, All born. in Sandisfield.
