2 CONT
2 CONT Daniel Phelps BIRTH	9 Oct 1763 Enfield, Hartford County, Connecticut, USA DEATH	21 Mar 1854 (aged 90) East Windsor, Hartford County, Connecticut, USA BURIAL	 Town Street Cemetery East Windsor, Hartford County, Connecticut, USA MEM
2 CONC ORIAL ID	17810459 · View Source SHARE  SAVE TOSUGGEST EDITS MEMORIAL PHOTOS 2 FLOWERS 1 FAG#47644196 provided the following info: From the book published in 1916 "Abbe -Abbey Genealogy In Memory of John Abbe and his Descendants" b
2 CONC y Cleveland Abbe and Joseph Genung Nichols:
2 CONT
2 CONT DANIELS PHELPS, son of Noah and Hannah (Abbe) Phelps, born in Enfield, Conn., October 9, 1763; died March 21, 1854, in East Windsor, Conn., where he had removed with his father. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Occupation: Farmer.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married (1) November 17, 1788, ELIZABETH PELTON, bom August 20, 1766, in East Windsor; died June 30, 1809. She was daughter of Nathan and Ruth (Thompson) Pelton.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married (2) December 30, 1812, RUTH PELTON, sister of Elizabeth, born in East Windsor, September 18 (or 19), 1769; died April 9, 1850.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children by first wife were born in East Windsor
2 CONT
2 CONT 1 - Ruth Phelps, b. Feb. 7 (or 17), 1790; d. in Warren, N. Y., March 16, 1848. Married Jan. 20, 1823, John Loomis, born, lived and died in Warren. Children, b. in Warren : i. William, settled in Hudson, Mich. ; ii. Charles, settle
2 CONC d in Oneida, N. Y. ; iii. Charlotte, m. -——^ Atherly and lived in Oneida.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2 - Hannah Phelps, b. Nov. 14 (or 24), 1791; d. June 5 (or 6), 1866, in East Windsor ; not m.
2 CONT
2 CONT 3 - Noah Phelps, b. Oct. 26, 1793 ; m. Lucy Barber.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4 - Daniel Phelps, jr., b. Dec. 29, 1795 ; d. Aug. 6, 1822 ; not m.
2 CONT
2 CONT 5 - Elizabeth Phelps, b. Dec. 30, 1797 ; m. Ashbel Barber.
2 CONT
2 CONT 6 - Mary Phelps, b. Feb. 20 (or 25), 1800; m. Jason Ellsworth.
2 CONT
2 CONT 7 - James Phelps, b. Sept. 15, 1802; farmer in East Windsor; d. there March 15, 1866. Married May 19, 1831, Mary Allen, b. in East Windsor, May 25, 1807; d. there 1894, daughter of Joel and Lydia (Butler) Allen. Children, b. in Ea
2 CONC st Windsor: i. Charlotte, m. Pease of Springfield (Stiles says she m. Ramsdell) ; ii. Mary, m. Ramsdell ; iii. James, jr.
2 CONT
2 CONT 8 - Charlotte Phelps, b. Sept. (or April) 29, 1804; d. in Warren, N. Y., April 7, 1829. Married May 11, 1828, Benjamin Allen and settled in Warren.
2 CONT
2 CONT 9 - Williain Phelps, b. Sept. 19, 1806 ; m. Mary Ann Soule.
2 CONT
