1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/11473116/edward-kibbe
2 CONT http://aleph0.clarku.edu/~djoyce/gen/report/rr04/rr04_454.html
2 CONT
2 CONT On 15 Feb 1691/2 when Edward was 22, he first married Rebecca Hadlock (10919) , daughter of James Hadlock (ca 1632-3 Dec 1687) & Rebecca Hutchinson (3708) (ca 1632-), in Springfield, MA. Born on 16 Dec 1664 in Salem, MA. Rebecca d
2 CONC ied in Oct 1692 in Somers, CT.
2 CONT
2 CONT (There’s no record for Rebecca’s birth in the Salem vital records.130)
2 CONT
2 CONT On 13 Nov 1693 when Edward was 23, he second married Dorothy Phelps, daughter of Jacob Phelps (7 Feb 1649/50-6 Oct 1689) & Dorothy Ingersoll (1654-), in Enfield, CT. Born on 10 May 1675 in Westfield, MA. Dorothy died aft 1756.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Edward and Dorothy (Phelps) Kibbe, born at Enfield:
2 CONT      i. Edward Kibbe, b. 16 Jul 1694;
2 CONT      ii. Dorothy Kibbe, b. ca. 1696, m. Benjamin Thomas;
2 CONT      iii. Elisha Kibbe, b. 23 Feb 1698, d. 1792 at Somers, CT;
2 CONT      iv. Jacob Kibbe, b. 21 Dec 1701, d. before 4 Jul 1772;
2 CONT      v. Israel Kibbe, b. 21 Oct 1704, d. 1792 at Somers;
2 CONT      vi. Rachel Kibbe, b. ca. 1707, d. ca. 1745, m. ca. 1725 Samuel Felt (son of Samuel Felt);
2 CONT      vii. Rebecca Kibbe, b. ca. 1710, m. ca. 1728 Samuel Bartlett;
2 CONT      viii. Anne Kibbe, b. ca. 1712, m. ca. 1732 James Kibbe (son of James & Hannah (Kelsey) Kibbe); and
2 CONT      ix. Naomi Kibbe, b. ca. 1715.
