1 CONT Root; both of Lebanon; Abigail, wh. m. 23 Aug. 1699, Joseph Pixley of Westfield; Rachel, w. ofCaleb Jones of Hebron; Eliz. wid.of Thomas Gridley sen.; Rebecca, w. ofSamuel Wood; both of Farmington; Martha, w. of Thomas Clark of Mi
1 CONC lford;Hann ah, bapt. 4 Apr 1680, wh. m. Joseph Woodruff of Farmington, and d.bef. her f.; and Martha, then unm." --From Savage, p. 395: SAVAGE: 'Genealogical Dictionary of the FirstSettlers of NewEngland'
1 CONT Rachel CLARK #1960 b. Abt 1670, Probably Hartford, Hartford, CT, m. CalebJONES #1961, b. Abt 1665, of Hebron CT. Best guess for birth date &location...
