0 @N6000000000310341284@ NOTE
1 CONT Hannah Spencer was born about 1681 and died about 1705. 
1 CONT Documented events in her life include mention in Will, Inv. or Prob.; 1705; Haddam, Middlesex Co CT. Received distribution of her share of the estate of her father. Listed as Azariah Dickinson & wife Hannah.
0 @N6000000006348338935@ NOTE Family Data Collection - Individual Records
1 CONT Name: Hannah Spencer
1 CONT Parents: Thomas   Spencer , Elizabeth   Bates
1 CONT Birth Place: Middlesex CO, Haddam, CT
1 CONT Birth Date: Sep 1676
1 CONT
1 CONT Family Data Collection - Individual Records
1 CONT Name: Hannah Spencer
1 CONT Spouse: Spencer Nathan
1 CONT Parents:   Bates Thomas ,     Elizabeth
1 CONT Birth Place: Haddam, CT
1 CONT Birth Date: 1676
1 CONT Marriage Date: 26 Nov 1717
1 CONT Death Date: 5 Jan 1754
1 CONT
1 CONT The second entry above seems to be in error, mixing up the surnames of her parents and also of her spouse.
1 CONT
1 CONT I find two comments in other data that makes her identity as both the daughter of Thomas Lawrence Spencer and also the wife of David Calkins and Nathan Howard suspect.
1 CONT
1 CONT "In 1754, still name Spencer, of Saybrook [Saybrook Deeds, 7:426]"
1 CONT "She was not named in the probate of her father's estate."
