1 CONC 1658; Edward, bapt. 13 Mar. 1659; Grace, 17 Feb. 1661; Ebenezer, b.
1 CONT 14, bapt. 17 Apr. 1664; Eliz. bapt. 26 Mar. 1666; Margaret, 27 Sept. 1668; Samuel, 9 Apr. 1671;and Martha, 3 Jan. 1675; was rep. 1678 and to 1686. His wid. Grace d. 6 June 1705, says the rec. but his own dec. is not ment. there.  
1 CONC He had rem. to New Roxbury, since call. Woodstock, and was d. 27 Jan
1 CONT 1692, when admin. on his est. was gr.  Grace his d. m. 7 Mar 1683, Benjamin Child; and Eliz. m. 9 May 1685, Joshua Child; and Margaret m. 4 Apr. 1689, John Johnson.
