1 CONT    4. Isaak, baptized 27 Dec 1634 at Great Bentley, buried there 5 Jan 1636/1637
1 CONT    5. John, baptized 4 Jan 1635/1636 at Great Bentley, buried there 5 Mar 1635/1636
1 CONT    6. Mathew, baptized 16 Jul 1637 at Great Bentley, buried there 23 Dec 1637
1 CONT    7. Mary or Marie, baptized 2 Dec 1638 at Great Bentley, died after 1656
