1 CONT
1 CONT mother of Captain Isaac Phelps of Westfield Mass.; Captain Abraham Phelps of E. Windsor, Conn., and Joseph. George and Frances had Jacob b. Feb. 7, 1649; John; and Nathaniel, b. Dec. 7, 1653.
