1 CONC field; Israel, b. April 3, 1681; Benjamin, b. Jan. 8, 1684; Joseph, b. Aug. 5, 1686; and Jedadia, b. Dec. 7, 1688; d. Feb. 13, 1752, m. Elizabeth Janes. The boys removed to Lebanon, Conn.
